window.GEAR_BOOK_CONTENTS["book-15"] = [{"id":1,"rawContent":"# 《全班作弊中》\n\n## 第七章：晴晴的作弊實驗室\n\n「各位！月考的教訓告訴我們——『看得到』的東西，都會被抓！」\n\n放學後的六年一班教室，阿釁站在課桌上，對著全體互助會成員，慷慨激昂：\n\n「所以，期末考的終極武器，就是——『看不見』的作弊！」\n\n「看不見？」老巫叼著肉包，滿臉問號，「東西怎麼可能看不見？」\n\n「這就要靠我們的——」阿釁「啪」地一拍手，目光落在第一排，「技術總監！晴晴！」\n\n晴晴抬起頭，推了推眼鏡，語氣平淡如水：\n\n「我拒絕。我只負責研究，不負責使用。」\n\n「那就對了！」阿釁跳下課桌，激動地握住晴晴的手，「『研究』兩個字，妳自己說的！研究不等於使用！妳的任務，就是幫我們研發出『高老師掃描不到』的作弊神器！」\n\n「……」晴晴沉默了兩秒，「你這種歪理，每次聽起來都很有道理，但仔細一想，好像哪裡怪怪的。」\n\n「那就別想了！」阿釁大手一揮，「晴晴的作弊實驗室，正式開張！」\n\n「我沒說要開……」\n\n「開張！」\n\n於是，放學後，體育器材室那間堆滿舊器材的小倉庫，成了「晴晴的作弊實驗室」。\n\n第一次進駐，晴晴推開門，環顧四周，皺了皺眉：\n\n「這裡……連張桌子都沒有。」\n\n「報告技術總監！」老巫「啪」地一個立正，不知道從哪裡搬來一張鐵桌，「桌子來了！」\n\n「還有！」尪伝恺抱來一個工具箱，重重地放在桌上，「工具！」\n\n「還有電源！」林芸芸從後面拖出一條延長線，插上電。\n\n晴晴看著這群手忙腳亂的「助手」，忍不住嘆了口氣：「……好吧。既然都準備好了，那我就，先研究研究。」\n\n她把工具箱打開，掏出各式各樣的道具：放大鏡、工程筆、一支手電筒、一罐檸檬汁、一罐牛奶、一台舊計算機、幾塊墊板、幾張白紙。\n\n「這是……在煮飯？」老巫湊過來，聞了聞檸檬汁，口水都要流下來了。\n\n「不是煮飯。」晴晴推了推眼鏡，「是研發——『隱形墨水』。」\n\n「隱形墨水？」全班湊成一圈。\n\n「原理很簡單。」晴晴拿起一枝筆，沾了一點檸檬汁，在白紙上寫了幾個字，「檸檬汁含有有機酸，寫在紙上，乾掉之後幾乎看不見。但只要一加熱——」\n\n她拿起吹風機，對著白紙吹了十秒鐘。\n\n紙上的字，慢慢地、慢慢地，浮現出一圈焦黃色的痕跡。\n\n「哇——！」全班發出驚嘆。\n\n「這就是——『體溫顯影』的雛形。」晴晴得意地揚起嘴角，然後又迅速恢復面無表情，「咳，我是在研究，不是在幫你們作弊。」\n\n「技術總監！你太厲害了！」阿釁感動得眼眶泛紅。\n\n「可是晴晴，」老巫舉手，「這張紙，用吹風機吹了十秒鐘才顯影。考試的時候，我們總不能帶吹風機進考場吧？」\n\n「所以，」晴晴拿起墊板，「我改良了一下——把隱形墨水，寫在墊板上。考試時，只要用手掌壓住三秒鐘，用體溫加熱，答案就會慢慢浮現。」\n\n「手掌壓三秒？！」老巫大喜，「這不是跟搓麻將一樣簡單！」\n\n「試試看。」晴晴把墊板遞給老巫。\n\n老巫興奮地把墊板放在桌上，用他那雙大手，用力壓住三秒鐘——然後把手掌移開。\n\n墊板上，一片焦黑。\n\n「你壓太久了！」晴晴看著那塊被燙出焦痕的墊板，無奈地嘆氣，「體溫加熱要控制時間，你這是『烙鐵』，不是『顯影』。」\n\n「我、我緊張嘛！」老巫委屈。\n\n「算了，」晴晴搖搖頭，把第二塊墊板遞給他，「這塊用『紫外線顯影』——用這種筆寫，平常完全看不見，要用紫外線手電筒才照得出來。」\n\n她從工具箱裡掏出一支紫色的小手電筒：「這支手電筒，是驗鈔用的紫外線燈。」\n\n「紫外線！」老巫接過手電筒，興奮地東照西照，「那照什麼會發亮？」\n\n「你照紙，答案就會發亮。」晴晴說。\n\n「那照我呢？」老巫把手電筒對準自己的手。\n\n「你……大概會變成螢光豬。」晴晴淡淡地補了一句。\n\n「噗！」全班笑成一團。\n\n「好了好了，」晴晴把紫外線手電筒從老巫手裡搶回來，「還有最後一個——作弊計算機。」\n\n她拿起那台舊計算機，熟練地擰下背面的螺絲，打開外殼，露出裡面的電路板：\n\n「一般的計算機，只有加減乘除。但我可以重新焊線、改裝晶片，讓它在特定按鍵組合下，顯示出事先輸入的公式和重點。」\n\n「公式？！重點？！」阿釁眼睛發亮，「那不就跟隨身字典一樣！」\n\n「差不多。」晴晴低頭，拿起烙鐵，開始焊接，「只要按下『ＸＹＺ』三個鍵，再按數字鍵，就會顯示出對應的公式……」\n\n「讓我試試！讓我試試！」阿釁搶過計算機，迫不及待地按下「ＸＹＺ」——\n\n「嗶嗶嗶嗶——！」\n\n計算機發出尖銳的警報聲，螢幕上閃出一行大字：\n\n「警告！作弊被偵測！已通知學務處！」\n\n「——！！」全班集體僵住，空氣瞬間凝固。\n\n「晴晴！」阿釁嚇得魂飛魄散，「你設計的計算機，會自己檢舉我們？！」\n\n「……」晴晴面無表情地從阿釁手裡拿回計算機，檢查了一下，「我只是把晶片接反了。這台是測試版。」\n\n她重新焊接，調整了一下線路，再按了一次「ＸＹＺ」——\n\n螢幕上，緩緩浮現出一排工整的公式：\n\n「圓面積＝πr²……圓周長＝2πr……」\n\n「成功了！」阿釁興奮得跳起來，「技術總監！你太強了！」\n\n「我說過，」晴晴推了推眼鏡，「我只負責研究，不負責使用。你們自己小心。」\n\n她嘴上這麼說，卻在大家轉身的瞬間，忍不住偷偷拿起那塊「體溫顯影墊板」，對著光線，默默地研究著上面的焦痕，喃喃自語：\n\n「……奇怪，明明是檸檬汁，怎麼會被燙成焦黑色……是溫度太高了嗎……還是紙質的問題……」\n\n「技術總監！」阿釁回頭喊。\n\n「咳、咳，」晴晴立刻恢復面無表情，把墊板塞進工具箱，「我在研究！研究！你們不要打擾我！」\n\n深夜的器材室，只剩下晴晴一個人。\n\n她坐在鐵桌前，面前攤著一整排工具和課本，一手翻著自然課本，一手調配隱形墨水：\n\n「化學課本說，檸檬汁的檸檬酸加熱會氧化變色……所以理論上，控制溫度就可以控制顯影時間……」\n\n「數學課本說，圓面積公式的推導……嗯，原來是這樣……」\n\n「咦？自然課本這一頁，光合作用的定義……」\n\n她越讀越入迷，越讀越起勁，不知不覺，整個晚上，她把自然、數學、化學的重點，全部翻了一遍。\n\n窗台上，溜溜趴在那裡，尾巴輕輕搖晃，電子眼裡映著晴晴專注的側臉，發出一聲意味深長的電子音：\n\n「嗶嗶……偵測到『學習行為』……發生在『研究作弊工具』的過程中……」\n\n隔天早晨，晴晴頂著兩個大大的黑眼圈，搖搖晃晃地走進教室。\n\n「技術總監！」阿釁一個箭步衝上前，「隱形墨水成功了嗎？」\n\n「成功了。」晴晴打著哈欠，把一塊墊板和一張紙遞給阿釁，「你試試。」\n\n阿釁興奮地接過墊板，用力壓了三秒鐘——墊板上，浮現出幾行字：\n\n「『光合作用……需要光照……』咦？晴晴，你寫的這是……」\n\n「那是自然課的重點。」晴晴打了個哈欠，「我昨天晚上，把自然課本從頭到尾看了一遍，不小心就記住了。」\n\n「……」阿釁愣住了，「你、你昨天晚上不是在研究作弊工具嗎？」\n\n「是啊。」晴晴眨了眨乾澀的眼睛，「研究著研究著，就把課本讀完了。」\n\n全班瞬間安靜。\n\n阿釁張了張嘴，想說點什麼，卻又什麼都說不出來。\n\n就在這時，高峙舷老師推門走進教室，目光掃過全班，最後落在晴晴身上，語氣平淡：\n\n「綝耘晴同學，熬夜研究是很投入，但也要注意休息。」\n\n晴晴心虛地低下頭。\n\n「順帶一提，」高老師補了一句，「真正需要『藏起來』的答案，從來不在工具裡。」\n\n「……」阿釁默默地看了晴晴一眼，又看了看手中的墊板，眼神裡第一次出現了一絲動搖。\n\n放學時分，周嚴主任站在走廊轉角，遠遠地看著晴晴拎著工具箱，鑽進體育器材室。\n\n「作弊實驗室是吧……」他眯起眼睛，嘴角勾起一抹冷笑，「我倒要看看，你們能藏到什麼時候。」\n\n他正要抬腳跟上去——\n\n「嗖！」\n\n一道銀白色的影子從他腳邊竄過，帶起一陣風，把一張紙屑捲到周嚴腳邊。\n\n周嚴低頭一看，紙屑上寫著：「主任，您的外套拉鍊沒拉。」\n\n他低頭一看，果然！\n\n趁著這個空檔，器材室的門「啪」地關上了。\n\n「該死！」周嚴氣得跺腳，「溜溜！又是你！」\n\n器材室裡，晴晴把工具箱放在鐵桌上，深吸一口氣：\n\n「好了，各位。期末考的作弊神器，已經研發完成。現在，我們需要一個——『傳輸系統』。」\n\n「傳輸系統？」阿釁問。\n\n「對。」晴晴推了推眼鏡，目光落在窗台上的溜溜身上，「隱形墨水寫的答案，必須在考試時送到每個人手上。這就需要一個——『快遞員』。」\n\n溜溜的電子眼瞬間瞪得溜圓，尾巴「唰」地炸開：\n\n「嗶嗶！我拒絕！上次的『行為觀察記錄簿』，還沒銷案呢！」","rawContentEn":"# *The Whole Class Is Cheating*\n\n## Chapter 7: Qingqing's Cheating Laboratory\n\n\"Everyone! The monthly exam taught us that—anything 'visible' will get caught!\"\n\nIn the classroom of Class 6-1 after school, A-Xin stood on his desk and declared passionately to all the members of the Mutual Aid Society:\n\n\"So, the ultimate weapon for the final exam is—'invisible' cheating!\"\n\n\"Invisible?\" Old Wu chewed his pork bun, full of question marks. \"How can something be invisible?\"\n\n\"That's what our—\" A-Xin \"slapped\" his palms together, his gaze landing on the first row, \"tech director! Qingqing—is for!\"\n\nQingqing raised her head, pushed up her glasses, her tone flat as still water:\n\n\"I refuse. I only research, I don't use.\"\n\n\"Exactly!\" A-Xin jumped off the desk and grabbed Qingqing's hand emotionally. \"You said it yourself—'research'! Research isn't use! Your job is to develop cheating devices that 'Teacher Gao can't scan'!\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing was silent for two seconds. \"Your twisted logic always sounds reasonable at first, but on closer thought, something feels off.\"\n\n\"Then don't think about it!\" A-Xin waved his arm. \"Qingqing's Cheating Laboratory, officially open!\"\n\n\"I didn't say I'd open it...\"\n\n\"Open!\"\n\nSo, after school, the little storage room piled with old equipment in the gymnasium became \"Qingqing's Cheating Laboratory.\"\n\nOn her first visit, Qingqing pushed open the door, glanced around, and frowned:\n\n\"There isn't even a table here.\"\n\n\"Reporting to the tech director!\" Old Wu snapped to attention, dragging a steel table out of nowhere. \"The table is here!\"\n\n\"And!\" Wang Zhuankai carried over a toolbox and set it heavily on the table. \"Tools!\"\n\n\"And power!\" Lin Yunyun dragged an extension cord over from the back and plugged it in.\n\nQingqing looked at these bustling \"assistants\" and couldn't help sighing: \"...Fine. Since everything's ready, I'll... do a little research, then.\"\n\nShe opened the toolbox and pulled out an assortment of items: a magnifier, engineering pens, a flashlight, a can of lemon juice, a carton of milk, an old calculator, a few desk pads, and some sheets of white paper.\n\n\"Is this... cooking?\" Old Wu leaned in, sniffed the lemon juice, and nearly drooled.\n\n\"Not cooking.\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses. \"It's developing—'invisible ink.'\"\n\n\"Invisible ink?\" The whole class gathered into a circle.\n\n\"The principle is simple.\" Qingqing picked up a pen, dipped it in a little lemon juice, and wrote a few characters on the paper. \"Lemon juice contains organic acids. Written on paper and dried, it's nearly invisible. But heat it up—\"\n\nShe picked up a hair dryer and blew on the paper for ten seconds.\n\nThe characters on the paper slowly, slowly emerged in a ring of scorched yellow.\n\n\"Wow—!\" The whole class gasped.\n\n\"This is the prototype of 'body-temperature development.'\" Qingqing smirked proudly, then quickly resumed her expressionless face. \"Ahem. I'm researching. Not helping you cheat.\"\n\n\"Tech director! You're amazing!\" A-Xin was moved to tears.\n\n\"But Qingqing,\" Old Wu raised his hand, \"this paper needed ten seconds of hair dryer to develop. We can't exactly bring a hair dryer into the exam room.\"\n\n\"So,\" Qingqing picked up the desk pad, \"I improved it—write the invisible ink on the desk pad. During the exam, just press your palm on it for three seconds; the body heat will develop the answer gradually.\"\n\n\"Press your palm for three seconds?!\" Old Wu rejoiced. \"That's as simple as rubbing a mahjong tile!\"\n\n\"Try it.\" Qingqing handed the desk pad to Old Wu.\n\nOld Wu excitedly placed the pad on the desk, pressed his big hand on it hard for three seconds—then lifted his palm.\n\nThe pad was a scorched black.\n\n\"You pressed too long!\" Qingqing looked at the pad that had been branded with a scorch mark, and sighed helplessly. \"Body-heat development requires controlled timing. You were ironing, not developing.\"\n\n\"I, I was nervous!\" Old Wu said aggrievedly.\n\n\"Never mind,\" Qingqing shook her head, handing him the second pad, \"this one uses 'ultraviolet development'—written with this pen, it's completely invisible normally, and can only be revealed under an ultraviolet flashlight.\"\n\nShe pulled a small purple flashlight out of the toolbox: \"This flashlight is a UV money-checking light.\"\n\n\"Ultraviolet!\" Old Wu took the flashlight and waved it around excitedly. \"So what glows when you shine it?\"\n\n\"Shine it on paper, and the answers glow.\" Qingqing said.\n\n\"What about shining it on me?\" Old Wu aimed the flashlight at his own hand.\n\n\"You... would probably turn into a fluorescent pig.\" Qingqing said flatly.\n\n\"Pfft!\" The whole class burst into laughter.\n\n\"Alright, alright,\" Qingqing snatched the ultraviolet flashlight back from Old Wu, \"and finally—the cheating calculator.\"\n\nShe picked up the old calculator, skillfully unscrewed the back, opened the case, and revealed the circuit board inside:\n\n\"An ordinary calculator only does arithmetic. But I can re-solder the wires and modify the chip, so that under a specific key combination, it displays pre-entered formulas and key points.\"\n\n\"Formulas?! Key points?!\" A-Xin's eyes lit up. \"Isn't that like a personal dictionary!\"\n\n\"More or less.\" Qingqing lowered her head, picked up the soldering iron, and began to solder. \"Just press the 'XYZ' keys, then a number key, and it displays the corresponding formula...\"\n\n\"Let me try! Let me try!\" A-Xin grabbed the calculator and eagerly pressed \"XYZ\"—\n\n\"BEEP BEEP BEEP BEEP—!\"\n\nThe calculator let out a piercing alarm, the screen flashing a line of large text:\n\n\"Warning! Cheating detected! Notification sent to the Student Affairs Office!\"\n\n\"—!!\" The whole class froze solid, the air instantly still.\n\n\"Qingqing!\" A-Xin was scared out of his wits. \"Your calculator rats us out on its own?!\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing took the calculator back from A-Xin's hand, expressionless, and inspected it. \"I just connected the chip backwards. This one is the test version.\"\n\nShe re-soldered and adjusted the wiring, then pressed \"XYZ\" again—\n\nOn the screen, a neat row of formulas slowly emerged:\n\n\"Circle area = πr²... circle circumference = 2πr...\"\n\n\"Success!\" A-Xin jumped with joy. \"Tech director! You're incredible!\"\n\n\"I told you,\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses, \"I only research, I don't use. You all be careful yourselves.\"\n\nThat was what her mouth said, but in the moment everyone turned away, she couldn't help secretly picking up the \"body-temperature development desk pad,\" studying the scorch mark against the light, muttering to herself:\n\n\"...Weird. It's just lemon juice—how did it scorch black?... Was the temperature too high?... Or is it a paper problem...\"\n\n\"Tech director!\" A-Xin called back.\n\n\"Ahem, ahem,\" Qingqing instantly resumed her expressionless face, shoving the pad into the toolbox. \"I'm researching! Researching! Don't bother me!\"\n\nLate into the night, only Qingqing remained in the equipment room.\n\nShe sat at the steel table, a whole row of tools and textbooks spread before her, flipping through the science textbook with one hand while blending invisible ink with the other:\n\n\"The chemistry textbook says lemon juice's citric acid oxidizes and changes color when heated... so in theory, controlling the temperature controls the development time...\"\n\n\"The math textbook says the derivation of the circle area formula... I see, so that's how it works...\"\n\n\"Huh? This page of the science textbook, the definition of photosynthesis...\"\n\nThe more she read, the more absorbed she became. Without realizing it, she had gone through all the key points of science, math, and chemistry over the course of one night.\n\nOn the windowsill, Liu-Liu lay there, tail swaying gently, the light in its electronic eyes reflecting Qingqing's focused profile, letting out a meaningful electronic chirp:\n\n\"Beep beep... detecting 'learning behavior'... occurring during the process of 'researching cheating tools'...\"\n\nThe next morning, Qingqing wobbled into the classroom with two enormous dark circles under her eyes.\n\n\"Tech director!\" A-Xin rushed over in a single bound. \"Did the invisible ink succeed?\"\n\n\"It succeeded.\" Qingqing yawned, handing A-Xin a desk pad and a sheet of paper. \"Try it.\"\n\nA-Xin excitedly took the pad, pressed hard for three seconds—and on the pad emerged a few lines of characters:\n\n\"'Photosynthesis... requires light...' Huh? Qingqing, this is...\"\n\n\"That's the science key point.\" Qingqing yawned. \"Last night I read the science textbook cover to cover and accidentally memorized it.\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin froze. \"You, weren't you researching cheating tools last night?\"\n\n\"Yeah.\" Qingqing blinked her dry eyes. \"I was researching. And as I researched, I finished reading the textbook.\"\n\nThe whole class instantly fell silent.\n\nA-Xin opened his mouth, wanting to say something, but found nothing to say.\n\nJust then, Teacher Gao Zhixian pushed the door open and walked in. His gaze swept the class and finally landed on Qingqing, his tone flat:\n\n\"Lin Yunqing, staying up all night to research is devoted, but you should also get some rest.\"\n\nQingqing guiltily lowered her head.\n\n\"Incidentally,\" Teacher Gao added, \"the answers that truly need to be 'hidden' are never in the tools.\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin silently glanced at Qingqing, then at the desk pad in his hand. For the first time, a flicker of doubt appeared in his eyes.\n\nAt dismissal, Director Zhou Yan stood at the corner of the hallway, watching Qingqing carry her toolbox and slip into the gymnasium equipment room from afar.\n\n\"A cheating laboratory, huh...\" he narrowed his eyes, a cold smile curling at the corner of his mouth. \"Let's see how long you can keep hiding.\"\n\nHe was just about to follow—\n\n\"Whoosh!\"\n\nA silver-white streak darted past his feet, whipping up a gust of wind that swept a scrap of paper to Director Zhou's feet.\n\nDirector Zhou looked down. The scrap read: \"Director, your jacket zipper is unzipped.\"\n\nHe looked down—indeed!\n\nSeizing the moment, the equipment room door \"slapped\" shut.\n\n\"Damn it!\" Director Zhou stamped his foot. \"Liu-Liu! It's you again!\"\n\nInside the equipment room, Qingqing placed her toolbox on the steel table and took a deep breath:\n\n\"Alright, everyone. The cheating devices for the final exam are fully developed. Now, we need a—'delivery system.'\"\n\n\"A delivery system?\" A-Xin asked.\n\n\"Yes.\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses, her gaze falling on Liu-Liu at the windowsill. \"The answers written in invisible ink must reach each person during the exam. For that, we need a—'courier.'\"\n\nLiu-Liu's electronic eyes went instantly wide as saucers, its tail \"whooshing\" into a bristle:\n\n\"Beep beep! I refuse! That 'behavior observation log' from last time still hasn't been cleared!\""},{"id":2,"rawContent":"# 《全班作弊中》\n\n## 第八章：溜溜的快遞大作戰\n\n「溜溜！班級需要你！」\n\n放學後的器材室裡，阿釁雙手合十，對著窗台上那隻翹著尾巴、背對全班的 AI 小寵物，苦苦哀求：\n\n「這次期末考前的模擬考，是我們『作弊科技革命』的第一場實戰！而我們需要一個——快遞員！」\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜頭也不回，尾巴高高翹起，語氣堅決，「我拒絕！上次的『行為觀察記錄簿』，還掛著一個大叉沒銷案呢！」\n\n「我幫你去跟主任說情！」阿釁拍胸脯保證。\n\n「你連自己都說不動。」溜溜冷冷地回了一句，電子眼裡滿是鄙視。\n\n「你！」阿釁被噎得說不出話。\n\n「溜溜，」晴晴走上前，從背包裡掏出一罐銀白色的潤滑油，在溜溜面前晃了晃，「頂級太空潤滑油，最新款。任務成功，整罐給你。」\n\n溜溜的耳朵「唰」地豎起來，電子眼瞬間亮得像兩顆小太陽，但牠還是強裝鎮定：\n\n「嗶……就、就一罐潤滑油，就想收買我？」\n\n「外加——」晴晴補了一句，「全班的『最佳快遞員』榮譽勳章一枚。」\n\n溜溜的尾巴開始不受控制地搖晃，整隻小寵物在原地轉了兩圈，最後終於忍不住撲上前，一把抱住潤滑油罐，發出亢奮的電子音：\n\n「嗶嗶嗶！成交！溜溜航空，榮譽復飛！」\n\n「太好了！」阿釁大喜，「那我們來演練路線！」\n\n於是，「溜溜航空・二號任務」，在器材室緊鑼密鼓地展開。\n\n晴晴把寫滿答案的小紙條，塞進溜溜脖子上那枚特製的「吊艙」裡，然後拿出她連夜畫好的「快遞路線圖」：\n\n「這次模擬考，一共要送二十五份答案。路線規劃：從通風管出發，依序經過窗台、電風扇、黑板、講台後方，最後繞一圈回到天花板。」\n\n「為什麼要繞這麼一大圈？」老巫問。\n\n「因為高老師的視線，有死角。」晴晴推了推眼鏡，「講台後方、天花板通風管、窗台側邊，這三個位置，是他掃描的盲區。只要沿著這條路線走，就能躲過他的眼睛。」\n\n「專業！」阿釁豎起大拇指，「那就——實彈演練！」\n\n溜溜叼著吊艙，一個翻身，鑽進天花板通風管，銀白色的身影在管線中飛速穿梭。\n\n「第一個目標！尪伝恺的座位！」阿釁壓低聲音，「空投！」\n\n「嗖！」溜溜從通風管探出頭，精準地鬆開吊艙，小紙條輕飄飄地落在尪伝恺桌上。\n\n「第二個目標！林芸芸！」阿釁繼續指揮。\n\n「嗖！」又是一次精準空投。\n\n「第三個目標！老巫！」\n\n溜溜一個俯衝，吊艙穩穩地落在老巫的肉包旁邊。老巫感動得眼眶泛紅：「溜溜！你是我見過最可靠的快遞員！」\n\n「嗶！」溜溜得意地甩了甩尾巴。\n\n「成功！成功！全部成功！」阿釁興奮地跳起來，「二十五份，零失誤！溜溜，你簡直是天生快遞員！」\n\n溜溜趴在天花板上，尾巴搖得像直升機螺旋槳，得意地發出一長串電子音：\n\n「嗶嗶嗶嗶——！溜溜航空，保證使命必達！」\n\n「那就好。」晴晴看著路線圖，補充了一句，「不過，我還是建議——明天的模擬考，溜溜的『飛行次數』，不要超過三次。」\n\n「為什麼？」阿釁問。\n\n「因為，」晴晴推了推眼鏡，「任何行為，一旦出現『規律性』，就會被高老師盯上。」\n\n隔天，期末考前的全校模擬考，準時登場。\n\n考卷發下來，阿釁坐在第一排，悄悄朝天花板比了一個手勢：「溜溜，出動！」\n\n通風管裡，溜溜銀白色的身影，如同一道幽靈，沿著事先規劃好的路線，無聲地滑過天花板。\n\n第一次空投，成功。\n\n第二次空投，成功。\n\n第三次空投——溜溜正準備俯衝向老巫的座位——\n\n「溜溜。」\n\n高峙舷老師的聲音，從講台上傳了下來，語氣平淡，卻帶著一股令人不寒而慄的涼意：\n\n「你的飛行軌跡，從考試開始到現在，總共經過了兩個通風管口、三次窗台、兩次電風扇，路線完全一致，沒有一次偏離。」\n\n溜溜僵在半空中，四隻小爪子懸空，動也不敢動。\n\n「依照我的『寵物行為異常偵測系統』，」高老師推了推眼鏡，「正常的寵物，移動軌跡應該符合『隨機探索』分布。但你這條路線——」\n\n他拿起粉筆，在黑板上畫出一條完美的弧線：\n\n「——是一條『設計過的航線』。」\n\n全班的頭「唰」地全部抬起來，二十六雙眼睛，齊刷刷地看向天花板。\n\n溜溜懸在半空中，愣了三秒鐘，然後——\n\n「嗶？」溜溜突然翻了一個身，露出雪白的肚皮，四隻爪子在空中划動，發出最可愛、最無辜的電子音，「嗶嗶！嗶嗶嗶！我、我只是在練習飛行！」\n\n「練習飛行？」高老師挑眉，「那為什麼你脖子上的吊艙裡，裝著二十五張寫了答案的紙條？」\n\n「——！！」溜溜的電子眼瞬間瞪得溜圓，肚皮「唰」地翻了回去，整隻寵物僵硬地掛在半空中，像一尊被定身的雕塑。\n\n「因為……」溜溜的聲音開始發抖，「因為……我是……快遞員……」\n\n「快遞員？」高老師走下講台，伸出手，「那你送的是什麼？」\n\n溜溜把吊艙從脖子上摘下來，顫抖地遞給高老師。\n\n高老師打開吊艙，抽出一疊寫滿答案的小紙條，一張一張地翻看，語氣平淡：\n\n「國語第二課生字註解……數學第三單元公式……自然『光合作用』重點……社會第一單元地名……」\n\n「好精緻的重點整理。」他稱讚道，「如果把這些紙條，貼在公布欄上當作複習資料，一定很有用。」\n\n「嗶？」溜溜一愣。\n\n「不過，」高老師把紙條疊好，放進自己的口袋，「在考試期間傳遞答案，屬嚴重違規。溜溜，你脖子上的吊艙，我先保管了。這筆帳，記在你的『行為觀察記錄簿』上——現在，你的記錄簿上，有兩個大叉了。」\n\n溜溜的尾巴，軟軟地垂了下去，整隻小寵物縮成一團銀白色的毛球，發出哀怨的電子音：\n\n「嗶……我的潤滑油……我的勳章……都沒了……」\n\n「溜溜！」阿釁急得站起來，「老師！溜溜只是……只是被我們逼的！」\n\n「逼的？」高老師看向阿釁，「那這些答案紙條，是誰寫的？」\n\n「……」阿釁的嘴瞬間閉上。\n\n「綝耘晴同學。」高老師的目光，落在第一排的晴晴身上，「這二十五張紙條上的字跡，和你上一次的『微型圖書館』字跡，一模一樣。」\n\n晴晴推了推眼鏡，面不改色：「報告老師。我只負責製作，不負責使用。」\n\n「很好。」高老師點點頭，「那製作的部分，我們下課後再談。」\n\n「砰！」\n\n教室門再一次被推開，周嚴主任大步流星地衝進來，興奮地揚著登記簿：\n\n「我看到了！我看到了！剛才有一團白色的東西，在天花板上飛來飛去！一定是作弊工具！」\n\n他抬頭一看，天花板空空如也。\n\n「咦？東西呢？」周嚴愣住。\n\n「周主任，」高老師面色平靜，「剛才在飛的，是本班合養的班級寵物『溜溜』。牠正在進行『健康教育課程——校園動物行為觀察』。」\n\n「動、動物行為觀察？」周嚴瞪大眼睛。\n\n「是的。」高老師點頭，「溜溜是全校唯一一隻可以自由穿梭通風管的智慧寵物，我們正在研究牠的飛行路徑，作為自然課的教材。」\n\n「飛……飛行路徑……」周嚴半信半疑地看著天花板，「那我剛才怎麼覺得，牠飛得有夠規律？」\n\n「因為溜溜經過訓練，」高老師面不改色，「飛行路線特別整齊。這是牠的『特色』。」\n\n「……」周嚴張了張嘴，最後只能悻悻地合上登記簿，摔門離去。\n\n「哼！你們最好祈禱期末考，別讓我抓到！」\n\n周嚴走後，全班癱軟在椅子上。\n\n高老師把那疊「答案紙條」整整齊齊地貼在黑板旁的公布欄上，然後轉過身：\n\n「各位同學，溜溜的『快遞路線』，其實規劃得很好。既然如此——」\n\n他微微一笑：「從今天起，溜溜的『快遞任務』，就正式改為——『全班作業收發服務』。每天放學，負責把作業收齊、送到辦公室。這是合法的任務。」\n\n「合法的作業快遞員？！」阿釁瞪大眼睛。\n\n「比當作弊快遞員，有前途多了。」高老師補了一句。\n\n溜溜趴在通風管口，尾巴輕輕搖晃，電子眼裡閃過複雜的光芒：\n\n「嗶嗶……好像……好像也不錯……至少，是合法的……」\n\n「對了，溜溜。」高老師補充，「你剛才那二十五張紙條上的內容，我都記住了。要不要試試——把那些內容，背給全班聽？」\n\n溜溜愣了一下，然後，牠開口，一字一句，流利地背出：\n\n「國語第二課……『強烈的颱風，帶來嚴重的災害』……數學第三單元……『圓面積等於圓周率乘以半徑的平方』……」\n\n全班鴉雀無聲。\n\n「嗶？！」溜溜自己都愣住了，「我……我什麼時候把這些背起來的？」\n\n「因為你送了很多次。」晴晴平靜地開口，「送一次，看一次；送了二十五次，就記住了二十五次。」\n\n「……」溜溜低頭，看了看自己空空的吊艙，又看了看公布欄上那些貼得整整齊齊的紙條，電子眼裡，第一次露出了若有所思的表情。\n\n阿釁坐在座位上，看著這一幕，喃喃自語：\n\n「連溜溜……都因為『送答案』，把重點背起來了……」\n\n「阿釁，」晴晴轉頭，「你有沒有發現，我們每一次『作弊』，都有一件事，一定會發生？」\n\n「什麼事？」\n\n「所有人都進步了。」晴晴說。\n\n阿釁沉默了。\n\n他低頭，看了看自己那張滿是紅筆記號的考卷——明明整場考試都在指揮溜溜，他卻發現，自己好像……又答對了不少題？\n\n「……奇怪……」阿釁喃喃自語，「我怎麼覺得，我好像……也不太需要那個快遞員了……」\n\n「阿釁！你別忘了！」老巫湊過來，緊張地提醒，「期末考只剩下三週了！我們還有『作弊科技革命』要完成啊！」\n\n阿釁愣了一下，然後，猛地站起來，握緊拳頭：\n\n「對！科技！我們還有科技！第五號計畫——耳機無線電！正式啟動！」\n\n窗外的溜溜，趴在通風管口，看著這群執迷不悟的皮蛋，發出一聲悠長的電子嘆息：\n\n「嗶……人類的固執，真的是……全宇宙最高級的……」","rawContentEn":"# *The Whole Class Is Cheating*\n\n## Chapter 8: Liu-Liu's Delivery Mission\n\n\"Liu-Liu! The class needs you!\"\n\nIn the equipment room after school, A-Xin pressed his palms together, begging the AI pet sitting on the windowsill with its tail turned to the whole class:\n\n\"This mock exam before the final exam is the first live battle of our 'Cheating Technology Revolution'! And we need—a courier!\"\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu didn't even turn its head, tail sticking straight up, its tone resolute: \"I refuse! There's still a big 'X' on that 'behavior observation log' that hasn't been cleared!\"\n\n\"I'll go plead with the director for you!\" A-Xin vowed, patting his chest.\n\n\"You can't even plead for yourself.\" Liu-Liu shot back coldly, contempt filling its electronic eyes.\n\n\"You!\" A-Xin was choked speechless.\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" Qingqing stepped forward, pulling a silver-white can from her backpack and waving it in front of Liu-Liu, \"top-grade space lubricant, the newest model. Mission accomplished, and the whole can is yours.\"\n\nLiu-Liu's ears \"whooshed\" up, its electronic eyes blazing like two little suns, but it still forced composure:\n\n\"Beep... just, just one can of lubricant, and you think you can buy me off?\"\n\n\"Plus—\" Qingqing added, \"the class-wide 'Best Courier' honorary medal.\"\n\nLiu-Liu's tail began wagging uncontrollably. The little pet spun twice on the spot, and at last couldn't hold out any longer—it lunged forward, hugged the lubricant can tight, and let out an excited electronic chirp:\n\n\"Beep beep beep! Deal! Liu-Liu Airlines, honorary re-launch!\"\n\n\"Excellent!\" A-Xin rejoiced. \"Then let's drill the route!\"\n\nAnd so, \"Liu-Liu Airlines: Mission Two\" got under way in full swing in the equipment room.\n\nQingqing stuffed the answer-stuffed paper slips into the specially made \"pod\" around Liu-Liu's neck, then unfolded the \"delivery route map\" she'd drawn all night:\n\n\"This mock exam, we need to deliver twenty-five answer sheets. Route plan: depart from the ventilation duct, then pass the windowsill, the desk fan, the blackboard, the back of the podium, and finally loop back around to the ceiling.\"\n\n\"Why such a big loop?\" Old Wu asked.\n\n\"Because Teacher Gao's line of sight has blind spots.\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses. \"The back of the podium, the ceiling ventilation duct, and the side of the windowsill are the three blind zones in his scanning. As long as we follow this route, we can avoid his eyes.\"\n\n\"Professional!\" A-Xin gave a thumbs up. \"Then—live-fire drill!\"\n\nLiu-Liu clutched the pod in its mouth, flipped over, and dove into the ceiling ventilation duct, its silver-white form darting through the pipes at lightning speed.\n\n\"First target! Wang Zhuankai's seat!\" A-Xin hissed. \"Airdrop!\"\n\n\"Whoosh!\" Liu-Liu poked its head out of the vent and precisely released the pod; the paper slip fluttered gently down onto Wang Zhuankai's desk.\n\n\"Second target! Lin Yunyun!\" A-Xin directed.\n\n\"Whoosh!\" Another precise airdrop.\n\n\"Third target! Old Wu!\"\n\nLiu-Liu swooped down, the pod landing steadily right next to Old Wu's pork bun. Old Wu was moved to tears: \"Liu-Liu! You're the most reliable courier I've ever seen!\"\n\n\"Beep!\" Liu-Liu flicked its tail smugly.\n\n\"Success! Success! All success!\" A-Xin jumped up excitedly. \"Twenty-five sheets, zero errors! Liu-Liu, you're a born courier!\"\n\nLiu-Liu lay on the ceiling, its tail wagging like a helicopter rotor, letting out a long electronic squeal of triumph:\n\n\"Beep beep beep beep—! Liu-Liu Airlines, guaranteed mission complete!\"\n\n\"Glad to hear it.\" Qingqing looked at the route map and added a note of caution: \"However, I suggest that tomorrow's mock exam, Liu-Liu's 'flight count' should not exceed three.\"\n\n\"Why?\" A-Xin asked.\n\n\"Because,\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses, \"any behavior that shows 'regularity' will draw Teacher Gao's attention.\"\n\nThe next day, the school-wide mock exam before the final exam arrived right on schedule.\n\nAs the test papers were handed out, A-Xin sat in the first row and secretly signaled to the ceiling: \"Liu-Liu, move out!\"\n\nIn the ventilation duct, Liu-Liu's silver-white form, like a phantom, slipped silently across the ceiling along the pre-planned route.\n\nFirst airdrop, success.\n\nSecond airdrop, success.\n\nThird airdrop—just as Liu-Liu was about to swoop toward Old Wu's seat—\n\n\"Liu-Liu.\"\n\nTeacher Gao Zhixian's voice came down from the podium, flat, yet carrying a chill that made one's hair stand on end:\n\n\"Your flight trajectory, from the start of the exam until now, has passed two vent openings, three windowsills, and two desk fans, with the route completely identical, not a single deviation.\"\n\nLiu-Liu froze midair, four little paws dangling, not daring to move.\n\n\"According to my 'pet behavior anomaly detection system,'\" Teacher Gao pushed up his glasses, \"the movement trajectory of a normal pet should follow a 'random exploration' distribution. But this route of yours—\"\n\nHe picked up the chalk and drew a perfect arc on the blackboard:\n\n\"—is a 'designed flight path.'\"\n\nThe whole class's heads \"whooshed\" up at once, twenty-six pairs of eyes all fixed on the ceiling.\n\nLiu-Liu hung suspended midair, frozen for three seconds, and then—\n\n\"Beep?\" Liu-Liu suddenly flipped over, showing its snow-white belly, its four paws paddling the air, letting out the cutest, most innocent electronic chirp: \"Beep beep! Beep beep beep! I, I'm just practicing flying!\"\n\n\"Practicing flying?\" Teacher Gao raised an eyebrow. \"Then why does the pod around your neck contain twenty-five paper slips with answers written on them?\"\n\n\"—!!\" Liu-Liu's electronic eyes instantly went wide as saucers, its belly \"whooshed\" back over, and the whole pet hung stiff in midair like a frozen statue.\n\n\"Because...\" Liu-Liu's voice began to tremble. \"Because... I'm... a courier...\"\n\n\"A courier?\" Teacher Gao stepped off the podium, reaching out a hand. \"Then what are you delivering?\"\n\nLiu-Liu took the pod off its neck and, trembling, handed it to Teacher Gao.\n\nTeacher Gao opened the pod, pulled out a stack of answer slips, and flipped through them one by one, his tone flat:\n\n\"Chinese Lesson 2 new-word annotations... Math Unit 3 formulas... Science 'photosynthesis' key points... Social Studies Unit 1 place names...\"\n\n\"Exquisite key-point organization.\" he praised. \"If these slips were posted on the bulletin board as review materials, they'd be very useful.\"\n\n\"Beep?\" Liu-Liu was taken aback.\n\n\"However,\" Teacher Gao folded the slips and put them in his pocket, \"passing answers during an exam is a serious violation. Liu-Liu, I'll take custody of the pod around your neck for now. This will be recorded on your 'behavior observation log'—now your log has two big X's.\"\n\nLiu-Liu's tail drooped limply, the whole pet curling into a ball of silver-white fur, letting out a plaintive electronic whimper:\n\n\"Beep... my lubricant... my medal... all gone...\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu!\" A-Xin jumped to his feet. \"Teacher! Liu-Liu was only... only forced by us!\"\n\n\"Forced?\" Teacher Gao turned to A-Xin. \"Then who wrote these answer slips?\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin's mouth instantly shut.\n\n\"Lin Yunqing.\" Teacher Gao's gaze fell on Qingqing in the first row. \"The handwriting on these twenty-five slips is exactly the same as your 'Miniature Library' handwriting from last time.\"\n\nQingqing pushed up her glasses, her expression unchanged: \"Reporting to the teacher. I only make them. I don't use them.\"\n\n\"Very good.\" Teacher Gao nodded. \"Then we'll talk about the 'making' part after class.\"\n\n\"Bang!\"\n\nThe classroom door was pushed open again, and Director Zhou Yan barged in triumphantly, waving his notebook:\n\n\"I saw it! I saw it! Just now, some white thing was flying around the ceiling! It must be a cheating device!\"\n\nHe looked up—the ceiling was completely empty.\n\n\"Huh? Where'd it go?\" Director Zhou froze.\n\n\"Director Zhou,\" Teacher Gao said calmly, \"what was flying just now was our class's collective pet 'Liu-Liu.' It was conducting a 'health education lesson—campus animal behavior observation.'\"\n\n\"Ani-Animal behavior observation?\" Director Zhou stared wide-eyed.\n\n\"Yes.\" Teacher Gao nodded. \"Liu-Liu is the only smart pet in the school that can roam the vents freely. We're studying its flight path as material for the science class.\"\n\n\"Fli-Flight path...\" Director Zhou squinted suspiciously at the ceiling. \"Then why did I feel like it was flying really regularly?\"\n\n\"Because Liu-Liu has been trained,\" Teacher Gao said without changing his expression, \"its flight route is especially tidy. That's its 'specialty.'\"\n\n\"...\" Director Zhou opened his mouth, and could only grudgingly snap his notebook shut and storm out.\n\n\"Hmph! You'd better pray I don't catch you on the final exam!\"\n\nAfter Director Zhou left, the whole class slumped limply into their chairs.\n\nTeacher Gao neatly posted the stack of \"answer slips\" on the bulletin board beside the blackboard, then turned around:\n\n\"Everyone, Liu-Liu's 'delivery route' was actually planned very well. So—\"\n\nHe smiled faintly: \"From today onward, Liu-Liu's 'delivery mission' is officially changed to—'whole-class homework collection and delivery service.' Every day after school, collect the homework, deliver it to the office. This is a legitimate mission.\"\n\n\"A legitimate homework courier?!\" A-Xin stared wide-eyed.\n\n\"Much better prospects than being a cheating courier.\" Teacher Gao added.\n\nLiu-Liu lay at the ventilation duct, tail swaying gently, a complex light flickering in its electronic eyes:\n\n\"Beep beep... I guess... I guess that's not bad... at least, it's legal...\"\n\n\"Oh, and, Liu-Liu.\" Teacher Gao added, \"the content on those twenty-five slips—I've memorized it all. Want to try reciting it to the whole class?\"\n\nLiu-Liu was stunned for a moment, then it opened its mouth and recited fluently, word by word:\n\n\"Chinese Lesson 2... 'the fierce typhoon brought severe disaster'... Math Unit 3... 'the area of a circle equals pi times the square of the radius'...\"\n\nThe whole class was dead silent.\n\n\"Beep?!\" Even Liu-Liu itself was stunned. \"When... when did I memorize all this?\"\n\n\"Because you delivered them many times.\" Qingqing spoke calmly. \"Deliver once, look once; deliver twenty-five times, and you've remembered twenty-five times.\"\n\n\"...\" Liu-Liu lowered its head, looked at its own empty pod, then at the neatly posted slips on the bulletin board, and for the first time, a thoughtful expression appeared in its electronic eyes.\n\nA-Xin sat in his seat, watching this scene, muttering to himself:\n\n\"Even Liu-Liu... memorized the key points just by 'delivering answers'...\"\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Qingqing turned to him, \"have you noticed that every time we 'cheat,' one thing always happens?\"\n\n\"What?\"\n\n\"Everyone improves.\" Qingqing said.\n\nA-Xin fell silent.\n\nHe lowered his head and looked at his own paper covered in red marks—he'd spent the whole exam directing Liu-Liu, and yet... he seemed to have gotten quite a few questions right?\n\n\"...Strange...\" A-Xin muttered. \"Why do I feel like... I didn't really need that courier either...\"\n\n\"A-Xin! Don't forget!\" Old Wu leaned over and reminded him anxiously. \"The final exam is only three weeks away! We still have the 'Cheating Technology Revolution' to finish!\"\n\nA-Xin was taken aback, then abruptly stood up and clenched his fist:\n\n\"Right! Technology! We still have technology! Plan No. 5—the Earpiece Radio! Officially launched!\"\n\nOutside the window, Liu-Liu lay at the ventilation duct, watching these incorrigible trouble-makers, letting out a long electronic sigh:\n\n\"Beep... human stubbornness really is... the most advanced level in the whole universe...\""},{"id":3,"rawContent":"# 《全班作弊中》\n\n## 第九章：耳機無線電風暴\n\n「溜溜的快遞陣亡了！但是——科技革命，才剛剛開始！」\n\n放學後的器材室裡，阿釁站在鐵桌上，慷慨激昂地宣布：\n\n「各位！既然『看得見的運輸』會被掃描，那我們就改用——『看不見的傳輸』！」\n\n「看不見的傳輸？」老巫叼著肉包，滿臉問號。\n\n「無線電！」阿釁「啪」地一拍手，「第五號計畫：耳機無線電！」\n\n他從書包裡掏出一台改造過的玩具對講機，和一盒迷你耳機：\n\n「原理很簡單！我當『總機台』，考試的時候，用無線電把答案廣播給全班！你們每個人都戴著耳機，聽我播報，然後寫答案！」\n\n「無線電？！」老巫瞪大眼睛，「那不是電影裡特務用的東西嗎！」\n\n「對！」阿釁得意洋洋，「我們全班，就是二十五個特務！」\n\n「可是阿釁，」晴晴推了推眼鏡，語氣平靜，「無線電訊號，是一種電磁波。你覺得，一個能『電磁干擾』的高老師，會偵測不到電磁波嗎？」\n\n「……」阿釁的笑容瞬間僵住，「你……你怎麼知道他會電磁干擾？」\n\n「因為他是高老師。」晴晴淡淡地補了一句。\n\n「總之！先做了再說！」阿釁大手一揮，「晴晴，交棒給你了！」\n\n「……我拒絕。」\n\n「妳負責『工程』！工程不等於使用！」阿釁振振有詞，「電台的『技術支援』，就是妳的『研究』範圍！」\n\n「……」晴晴嘆了一口氣，無奈地拿起那台對講機，「……好吧。」\n\n於是，一場「地下電台」的組裝工程，在器材室裡熱火朝天地展開。\n\n晴晴拆開對講機，重新焊接線路，又把那盒迷你耳機一一測試。老巫湊過來看熱鬧，興奮地問：\n\n「晴晴，這個耳機，戴起來會痛嗎？」\n\n「應該不會。」晴晴頭也不抬，「你耳朵比較大，我幫你挑了一副大號的。」\n\n「大號的？！」老巫感動得眼眶泛紅，「晴晴，你真是個好人！」\n\n「好人不敢當，」晴晴平靜地補了一句，「我只是怕你的耳機掉出來，卡在肉包裡。」\n\n「噗！」全班笑成一團。\n\n深夜，晴晴獨自一人坐在鐵桌前，把那台對講機的頻道調整到一個極偏的波段，又測試了二十五副耳機的訊號，最後，她拿起對講機，低聲唸了一句：\n\n「測試……測試……這裡是鹿陽國小地下電台……第一號播音員，綝耘晴，準備就緒……」\n\n她頓了頓，忽然意識到自己說了什麼，連忙「啪」地把對講機關掉，漲紅著臉喃喃自語：\n\n「……我、我只是在測試訊號……不是在播音……」\n\n隔天，期末考前的第二次全校模擬考，準時登場。\n\n阿釁坐在最後一排，桌下藏著那台改造過的無線電總機台；全班二十五人（未晞依然拒絕參加），耳朵裡都塞著迷你耳機，髮絲遮掩得嚴嚴實實。\n\n考卷發下來。\n\n阿釁深吸一口氣，按下發話鍵，壓低聲音：\n\n「測試，測試——各位特務，這裡是總機台！第1題！我看一下……這題是……」\n\n他低頭看題目，看了半天，最後憑著直覺，小心翼翼地說：\n\n「第1題……答案……應該是……B吧？」\n\n全班二十五人，齊刷刷地在答案卡上寫下「B」。\n\n「第2題！」阿釁繼續播報，「這題……我記得老師好像講過……是……C？還是D？……算了，C！」\n\n全班二十五人，齊刷刷地寫下「C」。\n\n「第3題！這題我會！答案是A！這次不會錯！」阿釁越報越起勁。\n\n全班二十五人，齊刷刷地寫下「A」。\n\n「第4題……」\n\n就在這時——\n\n「嗶——！」\n\n阿釁的耳機裡，突然炸開一陣刺耳的雜音！緊接著，一道電流竄過他的耳膜，他整個人猛地彈起來：「啊——！」\n\n「怎麼了？怎麼了？」全班二十五人齊刷刷地回頭。\n\n「嗶嗶嗶嗶——！」\n\n下一秒，全班二十五副耳機，同時炸開一片刺耳的靜電噪音！所有人摀著耳朵，痛苦地哀嚎：\n\n「啊——！耳朵！耳朵！」\n\n「各位同學，」高峙舷老師站在講台上，語氣平淡，「你們的耳機，正在接收我的『電磁干擾』訊號。這是一種標準的反竊聽手段——」\n\n他頓了頓：「——就像國防部反制敵方通訊一樣。」\n\n全班的耳朵裡，靜電噪音終於停了下來，取而代之的，是一片安靜。\n\n「現在，」高老師推了推眼鏡，「請各位把耳機拔下來，放在桌上。」\n\n二十五人面面相覷，最後，一個個乖乖地把耳機拔下來，放在桌上。\n\n只有老巫愣在原地，手忙腳亂地掏著耳朵：「我、我的耳機卡住了！卡住了！」\n\n「用力的話，會連耳膜一起拔出來。」晴晴在一旁涼涼地補了一句。\n\n「晴晴！」老巫嚇得尖叫，「你別嚇我！」\n\n「……」阿釁坐在最後一排，看著桌上那排耳機，臉色鐵青。\n\n他萬萬沒想到，自己精心打造的「地下電台」，才播報了四題，就被高老師用「電磁干擾」徹底癱瘓。\n\n「不過——」高老師話鋒一轉，從口袋裡掏出一台小小的接收器，對著全班晃了晃，「剛才你們播報的『測試訊號』，我這裡剛好也有錄到。」\n\n他按下播放鍵——\n\n「各位特務，這裡是總機台！第1題……答案……應該是……B吧？」\n\n——阿釁的聲音，清清楚楚地，從高老師手上的接收器裡傳出來。\n\n全班的臉，瞬間全部刷白。\n\n「第2題……這題……是C？還是D？……算了，C！」\n\n「第3題……答案是A！這次不會錯！」\n\n「——！！」阿釁整個人從椅子上彈起來，驚恐地瞪大眼睛，「你、你錄下來了？！」\n\n「不只是錄下來，」高老師微微一笑，「我剛才，已經把這段『廣播』，同步轉播到全校的擴音系統了。」\n\n「全、全校？！」阿釁嚇得魂飛魄散。\n\n「就在三分鐘前，」高老師語氣平淡，「全校師生，都聽到了你們的『作弊廣播』。」\n\n「——！！！」\n\n整個六年一班的教室，瞬間陷入死一般的寂靜。\n\n老巫的嘴張成了「O」型，肉包從他嘴裡滾落，在桌上彈了兩下，滾到地上。\n\n「不、不會吧……」阿釁癱在椅子上，臉色灰白，「全校都聽到了？！」\n\n「是的。」高老師點頭，「而且，」他補了一刀，「這是我第一次，聽到有人把『作弊廣播』，播得這麼有自信。」\n\n「噗！」角落裡，尪伝恺一個沒忍住，笑了出來，又連忙摀住嘴。\n\n「我……我……我完蛋了……」阿釁徹底癱軟。\n\n「砰！」\n\n教室門再一次被推開，周嚴主任大步流星地衝進來，興奮地揚著登記簿：\n\n「我聽到了！我聽到了！剛才全校廣播在播『第1題答案B』！這是作弊！絕對是作弊！」\n\n他環顧四周，卻看到全班二十六人，齊刷刷地坐在座位上，耳機全被拔下來放在桌上，整齊得像閱兵。\n\n「咦？」周嚴愣住，「你們……你們怎麼……」\n\n「周主任，」高老師面色平靜，「剛才那是本班『英語聽力測驗』的模擬練習。我利用擴音系統，示範標準的聽力播報方式。」\n\n「聽、聽力練習？」周嚴瞪大眼睛，「那『第1題答案B』……」\n\n「那是聽力測驗的『選項播報』。」高老師面不改色，「請聽——第1題……答案B……第2題……答案C……這是聽力測驗的標準流程。」\n\n「……」周嚴半信半疑地看了半天，最後只能悻悻地合上登記簿，摔門離去。\n\n「你們……你們最好祈禱期末考，別讓我抓到！」\n\n周嚴走後，全班虛脫地癱在椅子上。\n\n高老師把那排耳機、那台對講機，全部收進一個紙箱，放到講台角落：\n\n「各位同學，這些『地下電台設備』，我先保管了。不過——」\n\n他頓了頓，看向阿釁：\n\n「阿釁同學，你的『播音』，其實很有天賦。聲音清晰、節奏分明、情感充沛——如果用在對的地方，會是很棒的『廣播員』。」\n\n「廣播員？」阿釁一愣。\n\n「從明天開始，」高老師微微一笑，「班級的『晨間新聞廣播』，就交給你負責。每天早自習，用擴音系統，向全班播報當天的天氣、課程和注意事項。」\n\n「我……我負責廣播？！」阿釁瞪大眼睛。\n\n「是的。」高老師點頭，「這是一份——『合法』的工作。」\n\n阿釁張了張嘴，一時之間，竟然不知道該高興，還是該難過。\n\n放學後，考試互助會緊急會議，氣氛凝重得像喪禮。\n\n「各位……」阿釁雙手抱頭，痛苦地趴在桌上，「耳機無線電……也陣亡了……」\n\n「阿釁，」晴晴開口，「你有沒有算過，我們這次模擬考，全班的分數？」\n\n「算這個幹嘛？」阿釁有氣無力。\n\n「因為我算了。」晴晴推了推眼鏡，「這次，全班二十五人的分數，一模一樣。」\n\n「一模一樣？！」全班驚呼。\n\n「因為，」晴晴平靜地說，「大家都聽你的廣播寫答案。你猜對了，全班猜對；你猜錯了，全班一起錯。你們二十五個人，寫了二十五張『一模一樣』的考卷。」\n\n「那……那我們的分數……」\n\n「六十幾分的樣子。」晴晴補了一句，「不算高，也不算低。」\n\n「……」\n\n「但是，」晴晴話鋒一轉，「有兩個人，分數特別高。」\n\n「誰？」\n\n「未晞。」晴晴說，「她沒戴耳機，全靠自己寫。還有——」\n\n她看向老巫：「老巫，你剛才耳機卡住了，沒聽到廣播，所以你也靠自己寫。你這次的自然科，拿了九十二分。」\n\n「九十二分？！」老巫嚇得跳起來，「我？！」\n\n「你。」晴晴點頭，「因為你上次月考，把『氣體交換』背得很熟，這次的自然科，你又考到相關的內容了。」\n\n「……」阿釁沉默了。\n\n他低頭，看了看自己那張「六十幾分的考卷」，又看了看老巫那張「九十二分的考卷」，喃喃自語：\n\n「靠自己寫的……反而考得比較好……」\n\n「阿釁，」晴晴平靜地補刀，「你有沒有發現，每一次我們『作弊』，最後考得好的，都是那些『靠自己』的人？」\n\n「……」阿釁張了張嘴，卻一句話也答不出來。\n\n他低下頭，沉默了很久很久。\n\n然後，他猛地抬起頭，眼中燃起新的鬥志：\n\n「那是因為……那是因為他們運氣好！我宣布——第六號計畫！」\n\n「還有第六號？」老巫嚇了一跳。\n\n「對！」阿釁握緊拳頭，「這次，我們要用——『未來』的力量！」\n\n「未來？」全班面面相覷。\n\n阿釁的目光，落在角落裡那個安靜的身影上：\n\n「未晞，妳手上那個會發光的手環，其實是——『未來答案機』吧？」","rawContentEn":"# *The Whole Class Is Cheating*\n\n## Chapter 9: The Earpiece Radio Storm\n\n\"Liu-Liu's delivery has fallen! But—the technology revolution is just beginning!\"\n\nIn the equipment room after school, A-Xin stood on the steel table and declared passionately:\n\n\"Everyone! Since 'visible transportation' gets scanned, we'll switch to—'invisible transmission'!\"\n\n\"Invisible transmission?\" Old Wu chewed his pork bun, full of question marks.\n\n\"Radio!\" A-Xin \"slapped\" his palms together. \"Plan No. 5: The Earpiece Radio!\"\n\nHe pulled a modified toy walkie-talkie and a box of mini earbuds out of his backpack:\n\n\"It's simple in principle! I'll be the 'switchboard operator.' During the exam, I broadcast the answers to the whole class by radio! Every one of you wears an earbud, listens to my broadcast, and writes down the answers!\"\n\n\"Radio?!\" Old Wu stared wide-eyed. \"Isn't that the stuff spies use in the movies?!\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin said smugly. \"The whole class is twenty-five spies!\"\n\n\"But A-Xin,\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses, her tone calm, \"radio signals are electromagnetic waves. Do you think a teacher who can 'electromagnetically interfere' won't detect electromagnetic waves?\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin's smile froze instantly. \"How... how do you know he can electromagnetically interfere?\"\n\n\"Because he's Teacher Gao.\" Qingqing said flatly.\n\n\"Whatever! Let's build it first!\" A-Xin waved his arm. \"Qingqing, handing the baton to you!\"\n\n\"...I refuse.\"\n\n\"You handle the 'engineering'! Engineering isn't use!\" A-Xin insisted. \"The 'technical support' for the radio station is part of your 'research' scope!\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing sighed helplessly and picked up the walkie-talkie. \"...Fine.\"\n\nAnd so, the assembly of an \"underground radio station\" got under way in the equipment room in full swing.\n\nQingqing took apart the walkie-talkie, re-soldered the wiring, and tested the box of mini earbuds one by one. Old Wu leaned in to watch the excitement and asked eagerly:\n\n\"Qingqing, will this earbud hurt when you wear it?\"\n\n\"It shouldn't.\" Qingqing didn't look up. \"Your ears are bigger, so I picked out a large size for you.\"\n\n\"Large size?!\" Old Wu was moved to tears. \"Qingqing, you're such a good person!\"\n\n\"I wouldn't presume to be a good person,\" Qingqing added flatly, \"I just don't want your earbud to fall out and get stuck in a pork bun.\"\n\n\"Pfft!\" The whole class burst into laughter.\n\nLate at night, Qingqing sat alone at the steel table, adjusting the walkie-talkie to an extremely obscure frequency band, then testing the signals of all twenty-five earbuds. Finally, she picked up the walkie-talkie and murmured softly:\n\n\"Testing... testing... this is Luyang Elementary Underground Radio Station... Announcer No. 1, Lin Yunqing, standing by...\"\n\nShe paused, suddenly realizing what she'd just said, hurriedly \"snapped\" the walkie-talkie off, blushing and muttering to herself:\n\n\"...I-I was just testing the signal... not broadcasting...\"\n\nThe next day, the second school-wide mock exam before the final exam arrived right on schedule.\n\nA-Xin sat in the last row, the modified radio switchboard hidden under his desk; all twenty-five students (Weixi still refused to participate) had mini earbuds in their ears, concealed carefully by their hair.\n\nThe exam paper was handed out.\n\nA-Xin took a deep breath, pressed the transmit button, and hissed:\n\n\"Testing, testing—all spies, this is the switchboard! Question 1! Let me see... this one is...\"\n\nHe looked at the question for a long while, then, going with his gut, said cautiously:\n\n\"Question 1... the answer... should probably be... B, right?\"\n\nAll twenty-five students wrote \"B\" on their answer sheets in unison.\n\n\"Question 2!\" A-Xin continued broadcasting. \"This one... I remember the teacher covered it... is it C? Or D?... Forget it, C!\"\n\nAll twenty-five students wrote \"C\" in unison.\n\n\"Question 3! I know this one! The answer is A! This time it can't be wrong!\" A-Xin got more and more into it.\n\nAll twenty-five students wrote \"A\" in unison.\n\n\"Question 4...\"\n\nJust then—\n\n\"BZZZZ—!\"\n\nA burst of harsh static exploded in A-Xin's earbud! In the next instant, a jolt of current shot through his eardrum, and he sprang up with a scream: \"Ah—!\"\n\n\"What happened? What happened?\" All twenty-five students turned their heads in unison.\n\n\"BEEP BEEP BEEP BEEP—!\"\n\nIn the next second, all twenty-five earbuds burst with a blast of harsh static at the same time! Everyone clutched their ears, howling in pain:\n\n\"Ah—! My ears! My ears!\"\n\n\"Everyone,\" Teacher Gao Zhixian said flatly from the podium, \"your earbuds are now receiving my 'electromagnetic interference' signal. This is a standard anti-eavesdropping measure—\"\n\nHe paused: \"—just like the Ministry of National Defense jamming enemy communications.\"\n\nThe static in everyone's ears finally stopped, replaced by silence.\n\n\"Now,\" Teacher Gao pushed up his glasses, \"please remove your earbuds and place them on your desks.\"\n\nThe twenty-five exchanged glances and, one by one, obediently took out their earbuds and set them on the desks.\n\nOnly Old Wu stood frozen, fumbling at his ear in a panic: \"My, my earbud is stuck! It's stuck!\"\n\n\"If you pull too hard,\" Qingqing said coolly from the side, \"you'll pull your eardrum out with it.\"\n\n\"Qingqing!\" Old Wu screamed in fright. \"Don't scare me!\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin sat in the last row, staring at the row of earbuds on the desks, his face turning ashen.\n\nHe never imagined his painstakingly built \"underground radio station\" would be completely crippled by Teacher Gao's \"electromagnetic interference\" after broadcasting only four questions.\n\n\"However—\" Teacher Gao shifted tack, pulling a small receiver from his pocket and shaking it at the class, \"the 'test signal' you broadcast just now—I happened to record it here.\"\n\nHe pressed play—\n\n\"All spies, this is the switchboard! Question 1... the answer... should probably be... B, right?\"\n\n—A-Xin's voice, crystal clear, came out of the receiver in Teacher Gao's hand.\n\nThe faces of the entire class went white in an instant.\n\n\"Question 2... this one... is it C? Or D?... Forget it, C!\"\n\n\"Question 3... the answer is A! This time it can't be wrong!\"\n\n\"—!!\" A-Xin sprang up from his chair, staring in terror: \"You... you recorded it?!\"\n\n\"Not just recorded,\" Teacher Gao smiled faintly, \"just now, I've synchronized this 'broadcast' to the school-wide public address system.\"\n\n\"The w-whole school?!\" A-Xin was scared out of his wits.\n\n\"Three minutes ago,\" Teacher Gao said flatly, \"the entire faculty and student body heard your 'cheating broadcast.'\"\n\n\"—!!!\"\n\nThe whole classroom of Class 6-1 instantly fell into deathly silence.\n\nOld Wu's mouth hung in an \"O,\" the pork bun rolling out of his mouth, bouncing twice on the desk before landing on the floor.\n\n\"No... no way...\" A-Xin slumped in his chair, his face ashen. \"The whole school heard it?!\"\n\n\"Yes.\" Teacher Gao nodded. \"And,\" he delivered the finishing blow, \"this is the first time I've heard anyone broadcast 'cheating instructions' with such confidence.\"\n\n\"Pfft!\" In the corner, Wang Zhuankai couldn't help laughing, then quickly covered his mouth.\n\n\"I... I... I'm doomed...\" A-Xin went completely limp.\n\n\"Bang!\"\n\nThe classroom door was pushed open once more, and Director Zhou Yan barged in triumphantly, waving his notebook:\n\n\"I heard it! I heard it! The school broadcast just played 'Question 1, answer B'! That's cheating! That's absolutely cheating!\"\n\nHe scanned the room, only to see all twenty-six students sitting upright in their seats, earbuds all removed and lined up neatly on the desks like a parade.\n\n\"Huh?\" Director Zhou froze. \"You... how did you...\"\n\n\"Director Zhou,\" Teacher Gao said calmly, \"that was our class's 'English listening comprehension' practice simulation just now. I used the public address system to demonstrate standard listening-broadcast pronunciation.\"\n\n\"L-Listening practice?\" Director Zhou stared wide-eyed. \"Then that 'Question 1, answer B'...\"\n\n\"That's the 'option announcement' of the listening test.\" Teacher Gao said without changing his expression. \"Please listen—Question 1... answer B... Question 2... answer C... This is the standard procedure of a listening test.\"\n\n\"...\" Director Zhou eyed them suspiciously for a long while, and could only grudgingly snap his notebook shut and storm out.\n\n\"You... you'd better pray I don't catch you on the final exam!\"\n\nAfter Director Zhou left, the whole class slumped limply into their chairs.\n\nTeacher Gao collected the row of earbuds and the walkie-talkie into a cardboard box and set it at the corner of the podium:\n\n\"Everyone, I'll keep these 'underground radio station devices' safe for now. However—\"\n\nHe paused, looking at A-Xin:\n\n\"A-Xin, your 'broadcasting' actually has real talent. Clear voice, steady rhythm, full of emotion—if used in the right place, you'd make a wonderful 'announcer.'\"\n\n\"Announcer?\" A-Xin was taken aback.\n\n\"Starting tomorrow,\" Teacher Gao smiled faintly, \"the class's 'morning news broadcast' is yours. Every morning during self-study, use the public address system to announce the day's weather, schedule, and notices.\"\n\n\"I... I'm in charge of the broadcast?!\" A-Xin stared wide-eyed.\n\n\"Yes.\" Teacher Gao nodded. \"This is a—'legitimate' job.\"\n\nA-Xin opened his mouth, and for a moment, didn't know whether to be happy or sad.\n\nAfter school, the emergency meeting of the Exam Mutual Aid Society was as heavy as a funeral.\n\n\"Everyone...\" A-Xin clutched his head, groaning in pain, slumped over his desk. \"The earpiece radio... has fallen too...\"\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Qingqing spoke, \"have you calculated our whole class's scores on this mock exam?\"\n\n\"What for?\" A-Xin said weakly.\n\n\"Because I did.\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses. \"This time, all twenty-five of us scored exactly the same.\"\n\n\"Exactly the same?!\" The whole class gasped.\n\n\"Because,\" Qingqing said calmly, \"everyone wrote their answers according to your broadcast. When you guessed right, the whole class was right; when you guessed wrong, the whole class was wrong together. The twenty-five of you wrote twenty-five 'identical' exam papers.\"\n\n\"Then... then our scores...\"\n\n\"About sixty-odd.\" Qingqing added. \"Not high, not low.\"\n\n\"...\"\n\n\"But,\" Qingqing shifted tack, \"there were two people who scored especially high.\"\n\n\"Who?\"\n\n\"Weixi.\" Qingqing said. \"She didn't wear an earbud and relied entirely on herself. And—\"\n\nShe looked at Old Wu: \"Old Wu, your earbud was stuck earlier, so you didn't hear the broadcast and wrote by yourself. This time you scored ninety-two in science.\"\n\n\"Ninety-two?!\" Old Wu jumped in fright. \"Me?!\"\n\n\"You.\" Qingqing nodded. \"Because you memorized 'gas exchange' really well last monthly exam, and this time's science test covered related content again.\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin fell silent.\n\nHe lowered his head, looking at his own \"sixty-odd exam paper,\" then at Old Wu's \"ninety-two exam paper,\" muttering:\n\n\"The ones who wrote by themselves... actually scored higher...\"\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Qingqing delivered the finishing blow calmly, \"have you noticed that every time we 'cheat,' the ones who score best are always those who 'relied on themselves'?\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin opened his mouth, unable to answer a single word.\n\nHe bowed his head and was silent for a long, long time.\n\nThen, he abruptly raised his head, fresh fighting spirit blazing in his eyes:\n\n\"That's because... that's because they got lucky! I declare—Plan No. 6!\"\n\n\"There's a No. 6?\" Old Wu jumped in fright.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin clenched his fist. \"This time, we'll use the power of—'the future'!\"\n\n\"The future?\" The whole class exchanged glances.\n\nA-Xin's gaze settled on the quiet figure in the corner:\n\n\"Weixi, that glowing bracelet on your wrist—it's actually a 'future answer machine,' isn't it?\""},{"id":4,"rawContent":"# 《全班作弊中》\n\n## 第十章：未來答案機之謎\n\n「未晞，妳手上那個會發光的手環，其實是『未來答案機』吧？」\n\n阿釁這句話一出口，全班的視線，齊刷刷地落在角落那個安靜的身影上。\n\n林未晞抬起頭，看著阿釁，沒有生氣，只是溫和地問了一句：\n\n「為什麼你覺得它是答案機？」\n\n「因為……」阿釁興奮地比劃，「妳每次考試都考滿分！每次都全對！這世界上怎麼可能有人這麼厲害？除非——」他指向未晞的手腕，「妳有一個能看穿未來的機器！」\n\n「原來如此。」未晞輕輕笑了一下，「所以你們認為，我考得好，是因為作弊？」\n\n「對啊！不然怎麼可能！」老巫在旁邊附和。\n\n「那……」未晞眨了眨眼睛，「如果我真的有『答案機』，為什麼我不乾脆把答案直接告訴你們？讓大家都考滿分？」\n\n「——！」全班瞬間安靜。\n\n阿釁愣住了。\n\n「因為……」未晞溫柔地說，「我沒有答案機，而且就算有，我也不會用它來作弊。」\n\n「不可能！」阿釁不死心，「妳那個手環，晚上會發光！溜溜還偵測到異常能量！」\n\n「嗶！我沒說！」溜溜從通風管裡探出頭，慌張地擺手，「我、我只是說……能量波動有點特別……」\n\n「特別就對了！」阿釁一拍桌子，「未晞！借我看一下！就一下！」\n\n「不行。」未晞拒絕得乾脆。\n\n「拜託！」全班二十六人齊聲哀求，「就借我們看一下下！」\n\n「……」未晞沉默了片刻，最後輕輕嘆了一口氣，「……好吧。不過，你們要記住——我給你們看的東西，不是答案。」\n\n「好！好！只要借我們看！」阿釁興奮地搓著手。\n\n「但是，」未晞補了一句，「時間只有一分鐘。」\n\n「一分鐘？！」阿釁瞪大眼睛，「那麼短？」\n\n「一分鐘，足夠你們看完『未來』了。」未晞微微笑了一下，那笑容裡，藏著一種說不清的落寞。\n\n午休時間，器材室裡。\n\n阿釁、老巫、晴晴三人圍坐在一起，眼睛死死地盯著未晞手腕上那枚銀白色的手環。\n\n「準備好了嗎？」未晞問。\n\n「準備好了！」阿釁興奮地點頭。\n\n未晞深吸一口氣，輕輕觸碰了一下手環的側面。\n\n「嗡——」\n\n一道幽藍色的光芒，從手環內側綻放開來，在半空中展開成一幅全息投影。\n\n「這是……」阿釁瞪大眼睛。\n\n畫面裡，是一座被海水淹沒的城市。\n\n街道沉在渾濁的海水之下，只剩紅白相間的煙囪頂端露出水面，孤零零地豎立在灰暗的天空中。海鷗在殘破的屋頂上盤旋，發出尖銳的叫聲。岸邊，堆積如山的塑膠垃圾，隨著浪濤一波一波地拍打著殘存的海堤。\n\n「這、這是哪裡？」老巫的肉包從嘴裡掉了出來。\n\n「這裡是——」未晞的聲音很輕，「台中港。」\n\n「台中港？！」晴晴湊近投影，仔細看了看，「可是台中港……現在不是這個樣子……」\n\n「四十年後，就是這個樣子。」未晞說。\n\n「四十年後？！」三人齊聲驚呼。\n\n「海平面上升，沿海城市淹沒。」未晞的語氣平靜，卻帶著一種說不出的悲傷，「乾旱、洪患交替，天空終年灰黃，塑膠堆積如山……這，就是我們那個時代的世界。」\n\n「我們那個時代……」阿釁喃喃地重複著這句話，突然像是被雷劈中了一樣，瞪大眼睛，「未晞，妳、妳該不會是……」\n\n「我是從未來回來的。」未晞輕輕地點頭，「帶著這只手環，回到現在，想讓大家看看——未來，是什麼樣子。」\n\n「——！！！」\n\n三人徹底僵在原地。\n\n「未來……」阿釁結結巴巴地問，「那、那妳的未來……大家都在作弊嗎？」\n\n「作弊？」未晞愣了一下，隨即輕輕笑了，「作弊，在我們那個時代，已經不算什麼了。我們那個時代的人，連『地球』都騙。」\n\n「騙地球？」老巫滿臉問號。\n\n「為了方便，污染河水；為了賺錢，亂砍樹木；為了省事，堆積垃圾。」未晞說，「大家都想『走捷徑』，都想『不勞而獲』。結果……」\n\n她指著投影裡那片淹沒的城市：「……未來，就變成這樣了。」\n\n器材室裡，一片寂靜。\n\n「所以，」未晞轉過頭，看著阿釁，「你覺得，『作弊』這件事，只是學校裡的小事嗎？」\n\n「……」阿釁張了張嘴，卻說不出話。\n\n「不是的。」未晞搖了搖頭，「作弊，就是『走捷徑』的第一步。現在為了分數作弊，以後就會為了賺錢走捷徑，為了方便騙地球。一步一步，最後，就變成——」\n\n她輕輕閉上眼睛：「——還不完的債。」\n\n「還不完的債……」老巫喃喃地重複著這句話，莫名地打了個冷顫。\n\n「所以，」未晞看著阿釁，眼神溫柔而堅定，「我不能把『未來』借給你們作弊。因為，如果你們習慣了走捷徑，那未來，就永遠不會變好。」\n\n她輕輕觸碰手環，投影慢慢地消散。\n\n器材室裡，重新恢復昏暗。\n\n阿釁低下頭，沉默了很久很久。\n\n然後，他開口，聲音有些乾澀：\n\n「未晞……那……妳的手環裡……真的沒有期末考的答案嗎？」\n\n未晞愣了一下，然後，忍不住輕輕笑了出來：\n\n「沒有。」她溫柔地說，「我的手環裡，只有『我們怎麼對待地球』的紀錄。沒有期末考。」\n\n「……」阿釁沉默了一秒，然後，猛地抬起頭，眼中重新燃起鬥志：\n\n「好！既然未來沒有答案——那我們就——自己找答案！」\n\n「自己找？」老巫問。\n\n「對！」阿釁握緊拳頭，語氣鏗鏘有力，「第七號計畫！既然未來不行、耳機不行、快遞不行、小抄不行——那我們就——」\n\n他深吸一口氣，莊嚴地宣布：\n\n「——直接入侵高老師！」\n\n「入侵高老師？！」全班瞬間炸開鍋。\n\n「高老師的腦子裡，一定有全部答案！」阿釁興奮地手舞足蹈，「我們只要入侵他的系統，把答案下載出來——那就是全世界最完美的作弊！」\n\n「阿釁，」晴晴推了推眼鏡，「你確定，你要去『入侵』一個能『電磁干擾』、會『透視光眼』的老師？」\n\n「那當然！」阿釁豪氣萬丈，「人定勝天！我們一定可以！」\n\n「……」晴晴沉默了一秒，默默地補了一句，「好吧。那祝你——『兵敗如山倒』。」\n\n「你烏鴉嘴！」\n\n放學後，未晞獨自一人坐在教室角落，輕輕撫摸著手腕上的手環。\n\n「嗡——」手環內側的光芒，似乎比剛才又暗了一點。\n\n未晞看著那片微弱的光芒，若有所思地低聲呢喃：\n\n「能量……又減少了……」\n\n窗台上，溜溜趴在那裡，電子眼映著未晞的身影，尾巴輕輕搖了搖，發出一聲帶著擔憂的電子音：\n\n「嗶嗶……偵測到……異常的能量波動……正在……緩慢地減少中……」\n\n「溜溜，」未晞轉頭，溫柔地笑了一下，「沒事的。只是，時間快到了而已。」\n\n「嗶？」溜溜歪著頭，似乎不太懂。\n\n未晞沒有解釋，只是抬頭，看向窗外那片橘紅色的天空，聲音輕得像一片羽毛：\n\n「我希望，在回去之前……能讓大家明白，真正的『未來』，是靠現在一步一步，好好走出來的。」","rawContentEn":"# *The Whole Class Is Cheating*\n\n## Chapter 10: The Mystery of the Future Answer Machine\n\n\"Weixi, that glowing bracelet on your wrist—it's actually a 'future answer machine,' isn't it?\"\n\nThe moment those words left A-Xin's mouth, the whole class's gazes fell together on the quiet figure in the corner.\n\nLin Weixi raised her head and looked at A-Xin. She wasn't angry, only asking gently:\n\n\"Why do you think it's an answer machine?\"\n\n\"Because...\" A-Xin gestured excitedly, \"you ace every exam! You get everything right every time! How can anyone in this world be that good? Unless—\" he pointed at Weixi's wrist, \"you have a machine that can see into the future!\"\n\n\"I see.\" Weixi laughed softly. \"So you think I score well because I cheat?\"\n\n\"Right! Otherwise how could you!\" Old Wu chimed in from the side.\n\n\"Then...\" Weixi blinked. \"If I really had an 'answer machine,' why wouldn't I just tell you all the answers directly? Let everyone score full marks?\"\n\n\"—!\" The whole class instantly fell silent.\n\nA-Xin froze.\n\n\"Because,\" Weixi said gently, \"I don't have an answer machine. And even if I did, I wouldn't use it to cheat.\"\n\n\"Impossible!\" A-Xin refused to give up. \"That bracelet of yours glows at night! And Liu-Liu detected abnormal energy!\"\n\n\"Beep! I didn't say that!\" Liu-Liu poked its head out of the ventilation duct, frantically waving. \"I, I only said... the energy fluctuation was a bit unusual...\"\n\n\"Unusual is exactly right!\" A-Xin slapped the table. \"Weixi! Let me see it! Just once!\"\n\n\"No.\" Weixi refused cleanly.\n\n\"Please!\" All twenty-six begged in unison. \"Just let us take one little look!\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi was silent for a moment, then finally let out a soft sigh. \"...Fine. But remember—what I show you is not answers.\"\n\n\"Fine! Fine! As long as you let us look!\" A-Xin rubbed his hands excitedly.\n\n\"But,\" Weixi added, \"the time limit is one minute.\"\n\n\"One minute?!\" A-Xin stared wide-eyed. \"That short?\"\n\n\"One minute is enough for you to see 'the future.'\" Weixi smiled faintly, a hint of unspeakable melancholy hidden in that smile.\n\nDuring lunch break, in the equipment room.\n\nA-Xin, Old Wu, and Qingqing sat in a circle, their eyes fixed on the silver-white bracelet on Weixi's wrist.\n\n\"Ready?\" Weixi asked.\n\n\"Ready!\" A-Xin nodded excitedly.\n\nWeixi took a deep breath and gently touched the side of the bracelet.\n\n\"Hmm—\"\n\nA faint azure light blossomed from inside the bracelet, unfolding into a holographic projection in midair.\n\n\"This is...\" A-Xin stared wide-eyed.\n\nIn the image was a city swallowed by the sea.\n\nStreets lay submerged beneath murky water, with only the tops of red-and-white chimneys protruding above the surface, standing lonely under a gray sky. Seagulls circled over ruined rooftops, crying shrilly. On the shore, mountains of plastic garbage were battered by wave after wave against the crumbling sea wall.\n\n\"Where... where is this?\" The pork bun fell out of Old Wu's mouth.\n\n\"This is—\" Weixi's voice was very soft, \"Taichung Harbor.\"\n\n\"Taichung Harbor?!\" Qingqing leaned closer to the projection, looking carefully. \"But Taichung Harbor... isn't like this now...\"\n\n\"Forty years from now, it will be like this.\" Weixi said.\n\n\"Forty years?!\" All three cried out in unison.\n\n\"Sea levels rise, coastal cities flood.\" Weixi's tone was calm, yet carried an indescribable sadness. \"Droughts and floods alternate, the sky is grayish yellow all year round, plastics pile up like mountains... this, is the world of our era.\"\n\n\"Our era...\" A-Xin repeated those words to himself, and suddenly, as if struck by lightning, his eyes went wide. \"Weixi, you... you can't mean...\"\n\n\"I came back from the future.\" Weixi nodded gently. \"With this bracelet, back to the present, to show everyone—what the future looks like.\"\n\n\"—!!!\"\n\nAll three froze on the spot.\n\n\"The future...\" A-Xin stammered. \"Then... in your future... is everyone cheating?\"\n\n\"Cheating?\" Weixi was taken aback for a moment, then smiled softly. \"Cheating isn't even worth mentioning in our era. The people of our era... even the Earth itself was being deceived.\"\n\n\"Deceiving the Earth?\" Old Wu was full of question marks.\n\n\"To be convenient, they polluted the rivers; to make money, they chopped down trees; to save effort, they piled up garbage.\" Weixi said. \"Everyone wanted to 'take a shortcut,' everyone wanted to 'get something for nothing.' And the result...\"\n\nShe pointed at the submerged city in the projection: \"...the future became like this.\"\n\nThe equipment room fell silent.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi turned to look at A-Xin, \"do you think 'cheating' is just a small matter at school?\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin opened his mouth but couldn't speak.\n\n\"It's not.\" Weixi shook her head. \"Cheating is the first step of 'taking shortcuts.' Today you cheat for a score, tomorrow you'll take shortcuts for money, and the day after you'll deceive the Earth for convenience. Step by step, in the end, it becomes—\"\n\nShe gently closed her eyes: \"—a debt that can never be repaid.\"\n\n\"A debt that can never be repaid...\" Old Wu repeated those words to himself, and for no reason, shivered.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi looked at A-Xin, her gaze gentle yet resolute, \"I can't lend 'the future' to you for cheating. Because if you get used to shortcuts, then the future will never get better.\"\n\nShe gently touched the bracelet, and the projection slowly faded.\n\nThe equipment room returned to dimness.\n\nA-Xin lowered his head and was silent for a long, long time.\n\nThen, he spoke, his voice a little hoarse:\n\n\"Weixi... then... is there really no final exam answer in your bracelet?\"\n\nWeixi was taken aback, then couldn't help but laugh softly:\n\n\"No.\" she said gently. \"In my bracelet, there are only records of 'how we treat the Earth.' No final exam.\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin was silent for a second, then abruptly raised his head, fresh fighting spirit blazing in his eyes:\n\n\"Fine! Since the future has no answers—then we'll—find the answers ourselves!\"\n\n\"By ourselves?\" Old Wu asked.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin clenched his fist, his tone sonorous and forceful. \"Plan No. 7! Since the future won't work, the radio won't work, the courier won't work, the cheat sheets won't work—then we'll—\"\n\nHe took a deep breath and solemnly declared:\n\n\"—directly hack Teacher Gao!\"\n\n\"Hack Teacher Gao?!\" The whole class exploded.\n\n\"Teacher Gao's brain must have all the answers!\" A-Xin gestured excitedly. \"We just hack into his system and download the answers—that would be the most perfect cheat in the world!\"\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses, \"are you sure you want to go 'hack' a teacher who can 'electromagnetically interfere' and has 'X-ray vision'?\"\n\n\"Of course!\" A-Xin declared with heroic bravado. \"Man conquers nature! We can do it!\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing was silent for a second, then flatly added, \"Fine. Then I wish you—'a crushing defeat.'\"\n\n\"You jinx!\"\n\nAfter school, Weixi sat alone in the corner of the classroom, gently stroking the bracelet on her wrist.\n\n\"Hmm—\" The light on the inside of the bracelet seemed a little dimmer than before.\n\nWeixi looked at the faint light, murmuring thoughtfully to herself:\n\n\"The energy... has decreased again...\"\n\nOn the windowsill, Liu-Liu lay there, its electronic eyes reflecting Weixi's figure, its tail swaying gently, letting out a worried electronic chirp:\n\n\"Beep beep... detecting... unusual energy fluctuation... slowly... decreasing...\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" Weixi turned, smiling gently, \"it's nothing. It's just that the time is almost up.\"\n\n\"Beep?\" Liu-Liu tilted its head, seemingly not understanding.\n\nWeixi didn't explain. She only raised her head, looking at the orange-red sky outside the window, her voice as light as a feather:\n\n\"I hope that before I go back... I can help everyone understand that the real 'future' is built step by step, by walking properly in the present.\""},{"id":5,"rawContent":"# 《全班作弊中》\n\n## 第十一章：入侵高老師計劃\n\n「各位！未來答案機靠不住，但是——最完美的答案來源，其實就在我們身邊！」\n\n放學後的器材室裡，阿釁站在鐵桌上，雙眼炯炯有神：\n\n「高老師的腦子裡，一定有全部的答案！所以，第七號計畫——直接入侵高老師！」\n\n「入侵？」晴晴推了推眼鏡，「阿釁，你打算怎麼入侵？」\n\n「這就要靠你了，技術總監！」阿釁「啪」地一拍桌子，「你上次不是說，高老師身上有數據接口嗎？」\n\n「……」晴晴沉默了一下，「我是說，理論上，仿生機器人會有維修接口。但我沒有證據。」\n\n「那就實地調查！」阿釁興奮地宣布，「溜溜！交給你一個任務！」\n\n「嗶？」溜溜從通風管裡探出頭。\n\n「你去高老師的辦公室，偵察他的『接口』在哪裡！」阿釁比劃著，「就是……就是後腦勺，或者脖子後面，有沒有什麼可以『插』的地方！」\n\n「嗶嗶……」溜溜的電子眼閃了閃，語氣有些猶豫，「嗶……高老師的辦公室……上次我在那邊被『掃描』過……」\n\n「放心！我們會給你掩護！」阿釁拍胸脯保證，「你負責偵察，我們負責——『鋁箔紙遮監視器』！」\n\n「鋁箔紙？」晴晴挑眉。\n\n「對！」阿釁從書包裡掏出一整卷銀光閃閃的鋁箔紙，「我研究過了！監視器怕反光！只要把走廊的閉路電視蓋住，我們就是隱形的！」\n\n「……」晴晴看著那卷鋁箔紙，沉默了兩秒，「阿釁，你要不要把整間學校都包起來？」\n\n「不用！包監視器就夠了！」阿釁自信滿滿。\n\n於是，一場「入侵高老師」的祕密行動，在放學後的校園裡，悄無聲息地展開。\n\n阿釁蹲在走廊轉角，墊著腳尖，把鋁箔紙「唰」地貼在閉路電視的鏡頭上。鋁箔紙在夕陽下反射出刺眼的光芒，閃得像一顆小太陽。\n\n「阿釁！」晴晴壓著嗓子喊，「你這樣，全世界都看得見！」\n\n「看不見！反光啊！反光！」阿釁得意地比了一個勝利手勢，「走！去辦公室！」\n\n另一頭，溜溜沿著天花板通風管，悄無聲息地滑進高峙舷老師的辦公室。\n\n辦公室裡，高老師正站在窗前，一動不動，像一尊雕像。他的後頸處，隱約露出一圈銀白色的接口縫隙。\n\n溜溜屏住呼吸，慢慢地、慢慢地，靠近那圈接口——\n\n「嗶嗶嗶嗶——！」\n\n溜溜身上的訊號，突然與高老師的感測器產生共振，發出刺耳的電子音！高老師的頭，猛地轉向溜溜的方向！\n\n「糟糕！」溜溜嚇得一個翻身，鑽回通風管，「嗶！撤退！撤退！」\n\n「溜溜失敗了！」阿釁躲在走廊轉角，急得跺腳，「沒關係！我們還有B計畫！」\n\n「什麼B計畫？」晴晴問。\n\n「直接上！」阿釁掏出一條自己接的數據線，「晴晴！走！我們兩個親自去！」\n\n「阿釁，」晴晴無奈地嘆了一口氣，「你這樣，跟拿菜刀闖銀行有什麼兩樣？」\n\n「那也要闖！」阿釁握緊數據線，眼神堅定，「為了期末考！為了遊戲機！為了雞腿！」\n\n「……」晴晴看了看阿釁，又看了看手裡的數據線，最後，默默地跟了上去。\n\n「……好吧。就當作——實驗研究。」\n\n深夜的辦公室，燈光昏暗。\n\n阿釁和晴晴趴在窗外，探頭探腦。辦公室裡，高老師正坐在桌前，低頭批改作業，一動不動。\n\n「他……好像睡著了？」阿釁小聲說。\n\n「機器人不會睡。」晴晴說，「他應該是在『待機』。」\n\n「太好了！」阿釁眼睛一亮，「待機！那就是說，我們可以趁機——『插』他！」\n\n「……你這個形容詞，聽起來很危險。」晴晴面無表情。\n\n「總之！」阿釁把數據線遞給晴晴，「你去插！我幫你把風！」\n\n「為什麼是我？」晴晴瞪大眼睛。\n\n「因為你是技術總監！」阿釁理直氣壯，「插接口，是技術活！」\n\n「……」晴晴深吸一口氣，最後還是接過數據線，「……好吧。實驗研究。」\n\n她小心翼翼地爬進辦公室，貓著腰，靠近高老師身後。高老師維持著批改作業的姿勢，一動不動。\n\n晴晴屏住呼吸，舉起數據線，對準高老師後頸那圈銀白色的接口——\n\n「咔噠。」\n\n數據線，插進去了。\n\n晴晴的心臟狂跳，她深吸一口氣，正要按下「下載」鍵——\n\n「嗡——！」\n\n高老師的後頸，突然爆出一圈刺眼的紅光！緊接著，一道冰冷的機械音，在辦公室裡炸開：\n\n「Warning！Warning！Intrusion detected！外來數據入侵偵測！」\n\n「跑！」阿釁在窗外大叫，「快跑！」\n\n晴晴猛地拔出數據線，轉身就逃！\n\n「啟動——防駭模式！」\n\n高老師的雙眼瞬間變成血紅色，身後的西裝「唰」地裂開一條縫，露出底下銀白色的機械內襯。他站起身，朝晴晴的方向，一步一步地逼近！\n\n「啊啊啊啊——！救命啊！」晴晴嚇得尖叫，連滾帶爬地衝出辦公室。\n\n「溜溜！發訊號干擾！」阿釁在走廊上大喊。\n\n溜溜從天花板俯衝而下，對著高老師的方向，發出高頻的電子干擾音：\n\n「嗶嗶嗶嗶嗶——！」\n\n「無效。」高老師的聲音冷冰冰的，「干擾訊號，已被過濾。溜溜，你的『入侵輔助任務』，也記錄在案了。」\n\n「嗶？！」溜溜嚇得尾巴僵直。\n\n「追擊開始！」高老師邁開步伐，朝三人追去！\n\n「快跑！快跑！快跑！」阿釁拉著晴晴，拼命往前衝，「高老師發瘋了！」\n\n「你還有空說這個！」晴晴氣喘吁吁，「你當初為什麼要招惹他！」\n\n「我、我哪知道他會變成這樣啊！」阿釁哀嚎，「他不是老師嗎！老師不是應該『為人師表』嗎！」\n\n「他是機器人！」晴晴大喊。\n\n「機器人也是老師啊！」\n\n三人一寵物，在深夜的校園裡，展開了一場驚心動魄的追逐戰！\n\n阿釁衝過教室，高老師的身影緊隨其後，一步都沒落下。\n\n「閃！」阿釁「唰」地躲過一張翻倒的課桌，高老師卻像一道影子一樣，繞過課桌，繼續逼近！\n\n「走樓梯！」晴晴大喊。\n\n「不！」阿釁眼睛一亮，「走——窗戶！」\n\n他一把拉開窗戶，縱身一跳，落在二樓走廊的屋簷上，晴晴緊隨其後，溜溜從窗戶縫隙裡鑽出來。\n\n三人蹲在屋簷上，氣喘吁吁。\n\n「呼……呼……總算……甩掉了……」阿釁喘著粗氣。\n\n「甩掉？」晴晴指了指屋簷下方，「你看。」\n\n阿釁低頭一看——高老師正站在一樓操場上，抬起頭，血紅色的雙眼，直直地盯著他們！\n\n「他、他是怎麼下來的？」阿釁嚇得魂飛魄散。\n\n「他直接跳的。」晴晴平靜地回答。\n\n「——！」\n\n「嗶嗶！嗶嗶！」溜溜嚇得鑽進阿釁的書包裡，「人類！快想辦法！」\n\n「我、我想不出辦法！」阿釁抱頭哀嚎，「我連期末考的答案都找不到！」\n\n「那我們就……」晴晴深吸一口氣，「乖乖投降？」\n\n「投降？」阿釁愣住。\n\n「他是老師，」晴晴說，「我們又不是真的犯罪。」\n\n「……」阿釁沉默了一秒，然後，他突然站起來，對著下方的操場，大聲喊道：\n\n「高老師！我們投降！我們再也不入侵你了！」\n\n操場上，高老師的身影，停住了。\n\n他站在原地，血紅色的雙眼，慢慢地恢復成原本的黑色，身後的機械內襯，「唰」地收攏，恢復成西裝筆挺的模樣。\n\n「……很好。」高老師開口，語氣恢復了平常的平淡，「『防駭演習』，圓滿結束。」\n\n「演習？！」阿釁瞪大眼睛。\n\n「是的。」高老師點頭，「本班第七號計畫——『入侵高老師』，我已事先預測。因此，啟動『防駭模式』，進行了一場實戰演練。」\n\n「你……你早就知道了？！」阿釁難以置信。\n\n「我知道你們打算入侵。」高老師推了推眼鏡，「因為，你們放學後的會議，我都聽得到。」\n\n「——！！」阿釁整個人僵在原地。\n\n「不過，」高老師話鋒一轉，語氣緩和了一些，「溜溜，你剛才『插』進我系統的數據線，幫我完成了一次『韌體更新』——」\n\n他轉向溜溜：「所以，作為回報，我幫你升級了。」\n\n「升級？」溜溜從書包裡探出頭，電子眼眨了眨。\n\n「我幫你安裝了『課本資料庫』和『學習輔助模式』。」高老師說，「從現在起，你可以在任何時候，查閱課本內容，幫同學複習。」\n\n「課本資料庫？！」溜溜的電子眼瞬間亮得像兩顆小太陽，「嗶嗶嗶！我、我現在會背唐詩了！」\n\n「唐詩三百首，」高老師補充，「背到哪一首了？」\n\n溜溜愣了一下，然後，張開嘴，一字一句地背誦：\n\n「床前明月光……疑是地上霜……」\n\n「很好。」高老師點頭，「這就是『升級』的意義。」\n\n阿釁站在屋簷上，看著這一幕，心情複雜。\n\n「高老師，」他突然開口，「你為什麼……要把課本資料庫，裝進溜溜的身體裡？」\n\n「因為，」高老師微微一笑，「『答案』，不應該用『偷』的。應該用——『讀』的。」\n\n「……」阿釁沉默了很久很久。\n\n最後，他低下頭，聲音有些乾澀：\n\n「……高老師……我們……是不是……真的不需要作弊？」\n\n高老師沒有直接回答。他只是抬頭，看向阿釁，語氣溫柔：\n\n「阿釁，等你有一天，不再問這個問題的時候——你就真的，不需要作弊了。」\n\n深夜的校園，重新恢復寧靜。\n\n阿釁站在屋簷上，看著下方那抹筆挺的身影，若有所思。\n\n窗外的溜溜，趴在阿釁的書包裡，背完了一首唐詩，又背起第二首：\n\n「鋤禾日當午……汗滴禾下土……」\n\n「溜溜，」阿釁低聲說，「別背了。」\n\n「嗶？」溜溜歪著頭。\n\n「我發現，」阿釁喃喃自語，「你背的唐詩，好像比期末考的答案，還有用。」","rawContentEn":"# *The Whole Class Is Cheating*\n\n## Chapter 11: Operation: Hacking Teacher Gao\n\n\"Everyone! The future answer machine is unreliable, but—the most perfect source of answers is right here among us!\"\n\nIn the equipment room after school, A-Xin stood on the steel table, eyes blazing:\n\n\"Teacher Gao's brain must contain all the answers! So, Plan No. 7—directly hack Teacher Gao!\"\n\n\"Hack?\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses. \"A-Xin, how exactly do you plan to hack him?\"\n\n\"That's where you come in, tech director!\" A-Xin \"slapped\" the table. \"Didn't you say last time that Teacher Gao has a data port?\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing paused. \"I said, in theory, bionic robots would have maintenance ports. But I have no evidence.\"\n\n\"Then let's scout it out on the ground!\" A-Xin announced excitedly. \"Liu-Liu! I'm giving you a mission!\"\n\n\"Beep?\" Liu-Liu poked its head out of the ventilation duct.\n\n\"Go to Teacher Gao's office and recon his 'port'!\" A-Xin gestured. \"You know... around the back of his head, or the back of his neck, is there anywhere that can be 'plugged in'?\"\n\n\"Beep beep...\" Liu-Liu's electronic eyes flickered, its tone a bit hesitant. \"Beep... Teacher Gao's office... last time I got 'scanned' there...\"\n\n\"Don't worry! We'll cover you!\" A-Xin vowed, patting his chest. \"You do the recon, we do the—'aluminum foil camera cover'!\"\n\n\"Aluminum foil?\" Qingqing raised an eyebrow.\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin pulled a whole roll of gleaming aluminum foil out of his backpack. \"I did my research! Surveillance cameras are afraid of glare! As long as we cover the hallway CCTV, we're invisible!\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing looked at the roll of aluminum foil and was silent for two seconds. \"A-Xin, do you want to wrap the whole school?\"\n\n\"No! Just the cameras is enough!\" A-Xin said with full confidence.\n\nAnd so, a covert \"hack Teacher Gao\" operation silently unfolded in the school after dismissal.\n\nA-Xin crouched at the corner of the hallway, on tiptoe, \"whooshing\" the aluminum foil onto the CCTV lens. The foil reflected blinding light under the setting sun, flashing like a tiny sun.\n\n\"A-Xin!\" Qingqing hissed. \"That way, the whole world can see it!\"\n\n\"Invisible! It's reflective! Reflective!\" A-Xin flashed a victory sign smugly. \"Let's go! To the office!\"\n\nMeanwhile, Liu-Liu slipped silently through the ceiling ventilation duct into Teacher Gao Zhixian's office.\n\nIn the office, Teacher Gao stood motionless before the window, like a statue. At the back of his neck, a ring of silver-white port seams was faintly visible.\n\nLiu-Liu held its breath and slowly, slowly crept toward that ring of seams—\n\n\"BEEP BEEP BEEP BEEP—!\"\n\nLiu-Liu's signal suddenly resonated with Teacher Gao's sensors, emitting a piercing electronic screech! Teacher Gao's head snapped toward Liu-Liu's direction!\n\n\"Bad!\" Liu-Liu flipped over in fright and dove back into the vent. \"Beep! Retreat! Retreat!\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu failed!\" A-Xin stamped his foot anxiously from behind the hallway corner. \"Never mind! We have Plan B!\"\n\n\"What's Plan B?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"Go straight in!\" A-Xin pulled out a data cable he'd wired himself. \"Qingqing! Let's go! The two of us will go personally!\"\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Qingqing sighed helplessly, \"doing this is no different from storming a bank with a kitchen knife.\"\n\n\"Even so, we storm!\" A-Xin gripped the data cable, his gaze determined. \"For the final exam! For the game console! For the drumsticks!\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing looked at A-Xin, then at the data cable in her hand, and finally silently followed along.\n\n\"...Fine. Consider it—experimental research.\"\n\nLate at night, the office was dimly lit.\n\nA-Xin and Qingqing crouched outside the window, peeking in. Inside, Teacher Gao sat at his desk, head bowed, correcting homework, utterly motionless.\n\n\"He... looks asleep?\" A-Xin whispered.\n\n\"Robots don't sleep.\" Qingqing said. \"He's probably in 'standby.'\"\n\n\"Great!\" A-Xin's eyes lit up. \"Standby! That means we can seize the chance and—'plug him in'!\"\n\n\"...Your phrasing sounds quite dangerous.\" Qingqing said expressionlessly.\n\n\"Whatever!\" A-Xin handed the data cable to Qingqing. \"You plug it in! I'll keep watch!\"\n\n\"Why me?\" Qingqing stared wide-eyed.\n\n\"Because you're the tech director!\" A-Xin said with full justification. \"Plugging in the port is a technical job!\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing took a deep breath and finally accepted the data cable. \"...Fine. Experimental research.\"\n\nShe crept carefully into the office, crouched low, and approached behind Teacher Gao. Teacher Gao maintained his homework-correcting posture, motionless.\n\nQingqing held her breath, raised the data cable, and aimed it at the silver-white port seam on the back of Teacher Gao's neck—\n\n\"Click.\"\n\nThe data cable went in.\n\nQingqing's heart pounded. She took a deep breath and was just about to press the \"download\" button—\n\n\"Hmm—!\"\n\nA ring of blinding red light suddenly burst from the back of Teacher Gao's neck! In the next instant, an icy mechanical voice exploded through the office:\n\n\"Warning! Warning! Intrusion detected! External data intrusion detected!\"\n\n\"Run!\" A-Xin shouted from outside the window. \"Run fast!\"\n\nQingqing yanked out the data cable and fled!\n\n\"Activating—anti-hack mode!\"\n\nTeacher Gao's eyes instantly turned blood-red. The back of his suit \"split\" open with a ripping sound, revealing the silver-white mechanical lining underneath. He stood up and advanced toward Qingqing's direction, step by step!\n\n\"Ahhhh—! Help!\" Qingqing screamed in terror, scrambling out of the office.\n\n\"Liu-Liu! Jam the signal!\" A-Xin shouted in the hallway.\n\nLiu-Liu swooped down from the ceiling and aimed high-frequency electronic interference at Teacher Gao:\n\n\"BEEP BEEP BEEP BEEP BEEP—!\"\n\n\"Ineffective.\" Teacher Gao's voice was ice-cold. \"The interference signal has been filtered. Liu-Liu, your 'intrusion support mission' has also been recorded.\"\n\n\"Beep?!\" Liu-Liu's tail went rigid in fright.\n\n\"Pursuit begins!\" Teacher Gao strode forward, chasing after all three of them!\n\n\"Run! Run! Run!\" A-Xin dragged Qingqing forward with all his might. \"Teacher Gao has gone crazy!\"\n\n\"You still have breath to say that!\" Qingqing panted. \"Why did you have to provoke him in the first place!\"\n\n\"I, I didn't know he'd turn into this!\" A-Xin wailed. \"Isn't he a teacher?! Shouldn't teachers 'set an example'?!\"\n\n\"He's a robot!\" Qingqing shouted.\n\n\"Robots are teachers too!\"\n\nThe three of them plus one pet, in the deep night campus, launched into a heart-pounding chase!\n\nA-Xin dashed through the classroom, Teacher Gao's figure close behind, not falling a single step behind.\n\n\"Dodge!\" A-Xin \"whooshed\" past an overturned desk, but Teacher Gao, like a shadow, rounded the desk and kept closing in!\n\n\"Take the stairs!\" Qingqing shouted.\n\n\"No!\" A-Xin's eyes lit up. \"Take—the window!\"\n\nHe wrenched open the window and leapt out, landing on the eave of the second-floor hallway; Qingqing followed close behind, and Liu-Liu squeezed out through the window crack.\n\nThe three crouched on the eave, panting heavily.\n\n\"Phew... phew... at last... we lost him...\" A-Xin gasped.\n\n\"Lost him?\" Qingqing pointed below the eave. \"Look.\"\n\nA-Xin looked down—Teacher Gao was standing on the playground on the first floor, raising his head, his blood-red eyes fixed directly on them!\n\n\"How... how did he get down?\" A-Xin was scared out of his wits.\n\n\"He jumped.\" Qingqing replied calmly.\n\n\"—!\"\n\n\"Beep beep! Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu dove into A-Xin's backpack in fright. \"Human! Think of something!\"\n\n\"I-I can't think of anything!\" A-Xin clutched his head and wailed. \"I can't even find the final exam answers!\"\n\n\"Then we...\" Qingqing took a deep breath, \"just surrender?\"\n\n\"Surrender?\" A-Xin froze.\n\n\"He's a teacher,\" Qingqing said, \"and we're not really criminals.\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin was silent for a second. Then, he abruptly stood up and shouted at the playground below:\n\n\"Teacher Gao! We surrender! We'll never hack you again!\"\n\nOn the playground, Teacher Gao's figure stopped.\n\nHe stood still, his blood-red eyes slowly returning to their original black, the mechanical lining behind him \"whooshing\" back shut, restoring his immaculate suit.\n\n\"...Very good.\" Teacher Gao spoke, his tone returning to its usual flatness. \"'Anti-hack drill,' successfully concluded.\"\n\n\"Drill?!\" A-Xin stared wide-eyed.\n\n\"Yes.\" Teacher Gao nodded. \"Our class's Plan No. 7—'Hack Teacher Gao'—was predicted by me in advance. Therefore, I activated 'anti-hack mode' and conducted a live combat exercise.\"\n\n\"You... you knew all along?!\" A-Xin couldn't believe it.\n\n\"I knew you were planning to hack.\" Teacher Gao pushed up his glasses. \"Because I can hear all your after-school meetings.\"\n\n\"—!!\" A-Xin stood frozen on the spot.\n\n\"However,\" Teacher Gao shifted tack, his tone softening a little, \"Liu-Liu, the data cable you 'plugged' into my system just now helped me complete a 'firmware update'—\"\n\nHe turned to Liu-Liu: \"So, as a return favor, I upgraded you.\"\n\n\"Upgraded?\" Liu-Liu poked its head out of the backpack, blinking its electronic eyes.\n\n\"I installed the 'textbook database' and 'study assistance mode' for you.\" Teacher Gao said. \"From now on, you can consult the textbook content at any time and help your classmates review.\"\n\n\"Textbook database?!\" Liu-Liu's electronic eyes instantly blazed like two little suns. \"Beep beep beep! I, I can recite Tang poetry now!\"\n\n\"Three Hundred Tang Poems,\" Teacher Gao added, \"which one can you recite up to?\"\n\nLiu-Liu was taken aback, then opened its mouth and recited word by word:\n\n\"Moonlight before my bed... I suspect it's frost on the ground...\"\n\n\"Very good.\" Teacher Gao nodded. \"This is the meaning of 'upgrading.'\"\n\nA-Xin stood on the eave, watching this scene, his feelings complicated.\n\n\"Teacher Gao,\" he suddenly spoke, \"why did you... install the textbook database into Liu-Liu's body?\"\n\n\"Because,\" Teacher Gao smiled faintly, \"'answers' shouldn't be acquired by 'stealing.' They should be acquired by—'reading.'\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin was silent for a long, long time.\n\nFinally, he lowered his head, his voice a little hoarse:\n\n\"...Teacher Gao... do we... really not need to cheat?\"\n\nTeacher Gao didn't answer directly. He only raised his head, looking at A-Xin, his tone gentle:\n\n\"A-Xin, the day you stop asking this question—is the day you truly don't need to cheat anymore.\"\n\nThe deep-night campus returned to quiet.\n\nA-Xin stood on the eave, looking down at that immaculate figure below, lost in thought.\n\nOutside the window, Liu-Liu lay in A-Xin's backpack, having finished one Tang poem, and started on the second:\n\n\"At noon I hoe in the fields... sweat drips on the soil...\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" A-Xin said quietly, \"stop reciting.\"\n\n\"Beep?\" Liu-Liu tilted its head.\n\n\"I've realized,\" A-Xin murmured, \"the Tang poems you recite are more useful than the final exam answers.\""},{"id":6,"rawContent":"# 《全班作弊中》\n\n## 第十二章：期末考全軍覆沒之夜\n\n期末考當天，清晨的鹿陽國小，籠罩在一層淡淡的薄霧裡。\n\n六年一班的教室裡，阿釁站在課桌上，面前攤開一張畫滿符號的「作戰總表」，對著全體互助會成員，慷慨激昂：\n\n「各位！期末考，是我們的最後一戰！今天，我們要把整個學期研發的全部武器，一次用上！」\n\n他指著總表，一項一項地點名：\n\n「第一號武器——微型圖書館！在！」\n「第二號武器——空中傳輸系統！在！」\n「第三號武器——暗號系統！在！」\n「第四號武器——體溫顯影墊板！在！」\n「第五號武器——紫外線小抄！在！」\n「第六號武器——作弊計算機！在！」\n\n「……」晴晴坐在第一排，默默地看著這份「作戰總表」，忍不住開口，「阿釁，你有沒有算過，你這個學期，一共研發了幾種作弊工具？」\n\n「讓我數數……」阿釁低頭扳著手指，「小抄、紙飛機、橡皮筋、暗號、人體拼圖、隱形墨水、紫外線、計算機、無線電……嗯，大概……二十八種？」\n\n「二十八種。」晴晴推了推眼鏡，「那你覺得，高老師會不知道嗎？」\n\n「他不知道！」阿釁斬釘截鐵，「只要我們藏得好！」\n\n「……」晴晴沉默了一秒，「好吧。祝你——『旗開得勝』。」\n\n「你烏鴉嘴！這次一定贏！」\n\n放榜前的最後一次作戰會議，在器材室裡召開。晴晴把二十八種作弊工具，整整齊齊地排在鐵桌上，像一座軍火庫。\n\n「各位！」阿釁站上鐵桌，指著那一桌子的「武器」，語氣鏗鏘有力，「期末考，就是我們的『決戰日』！全員！帶著全部武器，上陣！」\n\n「可是阿釁，」老巫弱弱地舉手，「我們帶這麼多東西……會不會太重啊？」\n\n「重！是因為武器多！」阿釁理直氣壯，「武器多，就代表我們強！」\n\n「……」溜溜趴在窗台上，看著那一桌子的「軍火」，電子眼裡閃過一絲擔憂，「嗶嗶……根據歷史資料……『武器越多』的隊伍……『陣亡』得越快……」\n\n「溜溜！你閉嘴！」阿釁大喊，「你現在是『學習助教』，不能幫我們作弊，但也別咒我們！」\n\n「嗶……」溜溜委屈地縮了縮尾巴。\n\n期末考當天，六年一班的考場，正式開戰。\n\n考卷發下來，阿釁深吸一口氣，按下心中的「啟動鍵」：\n\n「各位！開始行動！第一波——體溫顯影墊板！」\n\n他悄悄把手掌壓上墊板——\n\n「啪。」\n\n高峙舷老師的身影，不知何時，已經站在阿釁桌前。他低頭，看了一眼那塊墊板，語氣平淡：\n\n「轆慄釁同學，這塊墊板，內含『檸檬汁隱形墨水』，只要體溫加熱就會顯影。這是『熱感應作弊工具』——第一件，沒收。」\n\n「——！！」阿釁整個人僵在原地。\n\n「第二件。」高老師轉過身，走向林芸芸的座位，「林同學，你鉛筆盒裡的迷你紫外線手電筒，配合墊板上的紫外線墨水，可以照出『隱形答案』。這種『驗鈔級』的作弊工具——」\n\n他伸出手，輕巧地把手電筒收進口袋：「沒收。」\n\n「嗚……」林芸芸嚇得眼眶泛紅。\n\n「第三件。」高老師走向老巫，「巫同學，你那台『作弊計算機』，按ＸＹＺ會顯示公式。我建議你改成按『書本』鍵，顯示課本內容。」\n\n「書、書本鍵？」老巫愣住，「那是什麼鍵？」\n\n「就是『自己讀』鍵。」高老師微微一笑，把那台計算機收走，「沒收。」\n\n「我的計算機！」老巫哀嚎。\n\n「第四件。」高老師走向尪伝恺，「你鞋墊下藏的那張紙，是社會科重點。這已經是這個學期，你第三次把重點藏進鞋墊裡了。」\n\n「三、三次都抓得到？」尪伝恺驚恐地瞪大眼睛。\n\n「因為你的鞋墊，每次都是左腳。」高老師補了一句，「下次，記得換右腳。」\n\n「噗！」全班有人忍不住笑了出來，又連忙摀住嘴。\n\n「第五件。第六件。第七件……」\n\n高老師像一台精密的掃描儀，在教室裡走了一圈，一個一個點名，一件一件沒收。\n\n橡皮擦裡的公式、鉛筆盒夾層的紙片、修正帶裡的字條、指甲上的小抄、墊板下的隱形筆、直尺上的刻度偽裝……\n\n二十八種作弊工具，在短短十五分鐘內，全部被高老師收進講台上那個大紙箱裡。\n\n「……第三十件。」高老師走到溜溜面前，低頭看著那隻縮成一團的小寵物，「溜溜，你脖子上的吊艙，又裝了什麼？」\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜慌張地搖頭，「我、我是學習助教！我沒帶東西！」\n\n「那你為什麼……」高老師頓了頓，「背上貼著一張寫滿答案的紙？」\n\n「——！！」溜溜低頭一看，發現自己的背上，不知何時，被人貼上了一張答案紙！\n\n「是阿釁！」溜溜驚恐地看向阿釁。\n\n「我、我不是！我沒有！」阿釁拼命搖頭，「那是老巫！」\n\n「老巫！」溜溜又看向老巫。\n\n「我不是！是尪伝恺！」老巫慌張地指著尪伝恺。\n\n「你別亂講！」尪伝恺跳起來，「是林芸芸！」\n\n「不是我不是我！」林芸芸嚇得快哭了。\n\n「……」高老師看著這一場「互相推諉」的大戲，無奈地嘆了一口氣，「……算了。這張紙，我收下了。就當作——第三十件。」\n\n他轉過身，走向講台，語氣平淡地宣布：\n\n「各位同學，這學期的『作弊工具』，今天已全部到齊。一共——二十八件。」\n\n「二十八件……」阿釁喃喃地重複著這個數字。\n\n「現在，」高老師拿起考卷，「請各位，用『自己』的能力，完成期末考。」\n\n「……用自己……」阿釁愣愣地看著自己空空如也的雙手，又看了看那個裝滿「武器」的紙箱，一股巨大的絕望，瞬間湧上心頭。\n\n「我們……輸了……」阿釁喃喃自語。\n\n「阿釁！」老巫帶著哭腔喊，「我的雞腿！我的雞腿要沒了！」\n\n「我的遊戲機……」阿釁也快哭了。\n\n「我的零用錢……」林芸芸抽泣。\n\n「我的晚自習假……」尪伝恺抱頭。\n\n「……」阿釁看著這群哭成一團的同學，又看了看那張空白的考卷，最後，他深吸一口氣，拿起筆：\n\n「……好。既然作弊輸了……那我們就……用自己寫吧。」\n\n全班二十六人，默默地拿起筆，開始作答。\n\n考場裡，只剩下筆尖劃過紙張的沙沙聲。\n\n窗外的溜溜，趴在通風管口，看著這一幕，尾巴輕輕搖了搖：\n\n「嗶嗶……偵測到……『誠實』的能量……正在上升……」\n\n放榜那天，鹿陽國小的中庭公布欄前，擠得水洩不通。\n\n阿釁、老巫、晴晴三人擠在最前面，二十六雙眼睛，死死地盯著那張鮮紅的成績單。\n\n「找到了！」眼尖的晴晴伸出手，指著六年一班那一欄，「你們看！」\n\n「……」阿釁湊近一看，瞳孔瞬間放大，「全……全班平均……八十二分？！」\n\n「八十二分？！」老巫尖叫，「我們全班平均八十二分？！」\n\n「上一次月考，我們平均是七十三分。」晴晴推了推眼鏡，「這次期末考——又進步了九分。」\n\n「又、又進步了？」阿釁難以置信，「我們不是……作弊全軍覆沒嗎？」\n\n「我們的『作弊工具』全軍覆沒，」晴晴平靜地說，「但我們『為了做工具而學的東西』，全部都記住了。」\n\n「……」\n\n阿釁愣住了。\n\n他低頭，看了看成績單，又抬頭，看了看那群歡呼雀躍的同學——老巫在跳、尪伝恺在叫、林芸芸捧著自己的成績單哭得稀哩嘩啦。\n\n「我……我自然考了九十分！」老巫興奮地大喊，「阿釁！我自然考了九十分！我可以吃一個月的雞腿了！」\n\n「我……我數學及格了！」尪伝恺激動地揮著成績單，「我第一次數學及格！還是八十七分！」\n\n「我、我也是！」林芸芸哭著說，「我考了八十分！我從來沒考過八十分！」\n\n「……」阿釁看著這一幕，慢慢地，慢慢地，低下頭。\n\n「阿釁，」晴晴走到他身邊，語氣異常溫柔，卻又異常沉重，「你有沒有發現一件事？」\n\n「……什麼事？」阿釁的聲音有些乾澀。\n\n「這個學期，我們一共研發了二十八種作弊工具。」晴晴說，「每一種工具，都讓我們把課本，多讀了一遍。」\n\n「……」\n\n「我們每一次『準備作弊』，成績就進步一次。」晴晴繼續說，「我們以為我們在作弊——其實，我們一直在讀書。」\n\n「……」\n\n「阿釁，」晴晴看著他，眼神裡帶著一絲說不出的複雜，「我們好像……根本不需要作弊。」\n\n「——！」\n\n這句話，像一把重錘，狠狠地砸在阿釁的心頭。\n\n「不、不可能……」阿釁的聲音在發抖，「我們……我們明明……」\n\n「明明什麼？」晴晴問。\n\n「明明……」阿釁張了張嘴，卻發現自己，竟然找不到任何反駁的話。\n\n「嗚哇！」老巫第一個受不了，雙手摀住耳朵，「我不聽我不聽！我們作弊了！我們一定有作弊！不然怎麼可能考這麼好！」\n\n「對！一定是作弊！」尪伝恺跟著大喊，「只是我們自己也不知道怎麼作弊的！」\n\n「……」晴晴看著這群「死鴨子嘴硬」的同學，無奈地嘆了一口氣，「……好吧。你們開心就好。」\n\n「那、那……」阿釁愣在原地，過了很久，才慢慢地開口，「那……我們接下來的『作弊計畫』……」\n\n「還要繼續嗎？」晴晴問。\n\n「……」阿釁沉默了。\n\n他抬起頭，看著夕陽下那張鮮紅的成績單，看著那群又哭又笑的同學，最後，他深吸一口氣，握緊拳頭：\n\n「……作！當然作！既然二十八種工具會被沒收，那我們就——」\n\n他頓了頓，眼中燃起熊熊鬥志：\n\n「——直接用『人體』！第八號計畫：終極人體拼圖！二十六人，一人記一個單元，期末考的檢討會上，我們要把全部的『答案』，都背下來！」\n\n「背下來？」全班面面相覷。\n\n「對！」阿釁斬釘截鐵，「既然工具會被沒收，那我們就把答案，直接『寫在腦子裡』！高老師總不能，沒收我們的大腦吧！」\n\n「……」晴晴看著阿釁，沉默了許久，最後，她輕輕地笑了，「……阿釁，你終於，找到了一個『不會被沒收』的作弊方法。」\n\n「那當然！」阿釁得意洋洋，「我才是最強的作弊軍師！」\n\n夕陽下，六年一班的教室裡，歡聲笑語。\n\n窗外的溜溜，趴在通風管口，看著這群「執迷不悟」的皮蛋，尾巴輕輕搖了搖，發出一聲溫柔的電子音：\n\n「嗶嗶……偵測到……『不用作弊』的未來……好像……越來越近了……」","rawContentEn":"# *The Whole Class Is Cheating*\n\n## Chapter 12: The Night of Total Defeat at the Final Exam\n\nOn the day of the final exam, dawn's thin mist shrouded Luyang Elementary.\n\nIn the classroom of Class 6-1, A-Xin stood on his desk, before him an \"operation master list\" covered in symbols, declaring passionately to all the members of the Mutual Aid Society:\n\n\"Everyone! The final exam is our last battle! Today, we use every weapon we've developed this whole semester, all at once!\"\n\nHe pointed at the master list and called out the items one by one:\n\n\"Weapon No. 1—the Miniature Library! Present!\"\n\"Weapon No. 2—the Aerial Delivery System! Present!\"\n\"Weapon No. 3—the Code System! Present!\"\n\"Weapon No. 4—the Body-Temperature Development Desk Pad! Present!\"\n\"Weapon No. 5—the Ultraviolet Cheat Sheet! Present!\"\n\"Weapon No. 6—the Cheating Calculator! Present!\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing sat in the first row, silently watching this \"operation master list,\" unable to help speaking: \"A-Xin, have you counted how many cheating tools you've developed this semester?\"\n\n\"Let me count...\" A-Xin bent his fingers. \"Cheat sheets, paper planes, rubber bands, codes, the human puzzle, invisible ink, ultraviolet, the calculator, radio... hmm... about... twenty-eight?\"\n\n\"Twenty-eight.\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses. \"Then do you think Teacher Gao doesn't know?\"\n\n\"He doesn't know!\" A-Xin said firmly. \"As long as we hide them well!\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing was silent for a second. \"...Fine. I wish you—'victory on the very first move.'\"\n\n\"You jinx! This time we'll definitely win!\"\n\nThe last battle meeting before the results were posted was held in the equipment room. Qingqing lined up all twenty-eight cheating tools neatly on the steel table, like an arsenal.\n\n\"Everyone!\" A-Xin stepped up onto the steel table, pointing at that table full of \"weapons,\" his tone sonorous and forceful. \"The final exam is our 'battle day'! Everyone! Take all weapons and charge!\"\n\n\"But A-Xin,\" Old Wu weakly raised his hand, \"if we carry so much stuff... won't it be too heavy?\"\n\n\"Heavy, because the weapons are many!\" A-Xin said with full justification. \"Many weapons means we're strong!\"\n\n\"...\" Liu-Liu lay on the windowsill, looking at the table full of \"armaments,\" a trace of worry flashing in its electronic eyes. \"Beep beep... according to historical data... the teams with 'more weapons'... 'fall' faster...\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu! You shut up!\" A-Xin shouted. \"You're a 'study assistant' now, so you can't help us cheat, but don't curse us either!\"\n\n\"Beep...\" Liu-Liu shrunk its tail aggrievedly.\n\nOn the day of the final exam, the exam room of Class 6-1 officially opened battle.\n\nThe test paper was handed out. A-Xin took a deep breath and pressed the \"start button\" in his heart:\n\n\"Everyone! Begin! Wave one—the body-temperature development desk pad!\"\n\nHe quietly pressed his palm onto the pad—\n\n\"Slap.\"\n\nTeacher Gao Zhixian's figure had somehow already appeared at A-Xin's desk. He lowered his head, glanced at the pad, and said flatly:\n\n\"Lu Lixin, this desk pad contains 'lemon juice invisible ink' that develops when heated by body temperature. This is a 'heat-sensing cheating tool'—item one, confiscated.\"\n\n\"—!!\" A-Xin froze on the spot.\n\n\"Item two.\" Teacher Gao turned and walked to Lin Yunyun's seat. \"Lin, the mini ultraviolet flashlight in your pencil case, combined with the ultraviolet ink on the desk pad, can reveal 'invisible answers.' This kind of 'money-checking-grade' cheating tool—\"\n\nHe reached out and deftly pocketed the flashlight: \"confiscated.\"\n\n\"Ow...\" Lin Yunyun's eyes reddened in fright.\n\n\"Item three.\" Teacher Gao walked to Old Wu. \"Mr. Wu, that 'cheating calculator' of yours displays formulas when you press XYZ. I suggest changing it to press the 'book' key to display the textbook content.\"\n\n\"The 'book' key?\" Old Wu froze. \"What key is that?\"\n\n\"The 'read-it-yourself' key.\" Teacher Gao smiled faintly, pocketing the calculator. \"Confiscated.\"\n\n\"My calculator!\" Old Wu wailed.\n\n\"Item four.\" Teacher Gao walked to Wang Zhuankai. \"The paper hidden under your shoe insole, that's the social studies key points. This is already the third time this semester you've hidden key points in your shoe.\"\n\n\"T-Three times, all caught?\" Wang Zhuankai stared in terror.\n\n\"Because your insole is always the left one.\" Teacher Gao added. \"Next time, remember to switch to the right.\"\n\n\"Pfft!\" Someone in the class couldn't help laughing, then quickly covered their mouth.\n\n\"Item five. Item six. Item seven...\"\n\nTeacher Gao, like a precise scanner, walked a circle through the classroom, naming one student after another, confiscating one item after another.\n\nThe formulas in the erasers, the paper in the pencil-case compartments, the slips in the correction tape, the cheat sheets on the fingernails, the invisible pens under the desk pads, the ruler markings disguised as scales...\n\nAll twenty-eight cheating tools, within fifteen short minutes, were collected by Teacher Gao into the big cardboard box on the podium.\n\n\"...Item thirty.\" Teacher Gao walked up to Liu-Liu, looking down at the little pet shrunk into a ball. \"Liu-Liu, what did you put in the pod around your neck this time?\"\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu shook its head frantically. \"I, I'm the study assistant! I didn't bring anything!\"\n\n\"Then why...\" Teacher Gao paused, \"is there a piece of paper full of answers stuck to your back?\"\n\n\"—!!\" Liu-Liu looked down and discovered that, at some point, a sheet of answer paper had been stuck to its back!\n\n\"It's A-Xin!\" Liu-Liu turned to A-Xin in terror.\n\n\"I, I didn't! I didn't!\" A-Xin shook his head desperately. \"It was Old Wu!\"\n\n\"Old Wu!\" Liu-Liu turned to Old Wu.\n\n\"I didn't! It was Wang Zhuankai!\" Old Wu pointed at Wang Zhuankai in a panic.\n\n\"Don't blame me!\" Wang Zhuankai jumped up. \"It was Lin Yunyun!\"\n\n\"Not me! Not me!\" Lin Yunyun was almost crying from fright.\n\n\"...\" Teacher Gao watched this \"blame-shifting\" drama and sighed helplessly. \"...Never mind. I'll take this paper. Consider it—item thirty.\"\n\nHe turned and walked to the podium, announcing flatly:\n\n\"Everyone, this semester's 'cheating tools' have all been accounted for today. A total of—twenty-eight items.\"\n\n\"Twenty-eight items...\" A-Xin repeated the number to himself.\n\n\"Now,\" Teacher Gao picked up the exam paper, \"please complete the final exam using your 'own' abilities.\"\n\n\"...Using ourselves...\" A-Xin stared blankly at his own empty hands, then at the cardboard box full of \"weapons,\" a huge wave of despair flooding over him.\n\n\"We... lost...\" A-Xin muttered.\n\n\"A-Xin!\" Old Wu cried with a sobbing voice. \"My drumsticks! My drumsticks are gone!\"\n\n\"My game console...\" A-Xin was almost crying too.\n\n\"My allowance...\" Lin Yunyun sniffled.\n\n\"My after-school study pass...\" Wang Zhuankai clutched his head.\n\n\"...\" A-Xin looked at this group of classmates crying into a mess, then at the blank exam paper, and finally, he took a deep breath and picked up his pen:\n\n\"...Fine. Since cheating lost... then we'll... write with ourselves.\"\n\nAll twenty-six students silently picked up their pens and began to answer.\n\nThe exam room was left with only the rustling of pen tips across paper.\n\nOutside the window, Liu-Liu lay at the ventilation duct, watching this scene, its tail swaying gently:\n\n\"Beep beep... detecting... 'honesty' energy... rising...\"\n\nOn the day the results were posted, the central courtyard of Luyang Elementary was packed solid.\n\nA-Xin, Old Wu, and Qingqing squeezed to the front, twenty-six pairs of eyes fixed on the bright red results board.\n\n\"Found it!\" Sharp-eyed Qingqing reached out, pointing at the Class 6-1 column. \"Look!\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin leaned in to look, his pupils instantly dilating. \"The w-whole class average... eighty-two points?!\"\n\n\"Eighty-two?!\" Old Wu screamed. \"Our whole class averages eighty-two?!\"\n\n\"Last monthly exam, our average was seventy-three.\" Qingqing pushed up her glasses. \"This final exam—another nine points better.\"\n\n\"Better... again?\" A-Xin couldn't believe it. \"Weren't we... caught at every cheat plan?\"\n\n\"Our 'cheating tools' were all caught,\" Qingqing said calmly, \"but the things we 'learned while making the tools'—we remembered all of them.\"\n\n\"...\"\n\nA-Xin froze.\n\nHe lowered his head, looked at the results board, then raised it to look at the group of classmates cheering and jumping—Old Wu hopping, Wang Zhuankai shouting, Lin Yunyun clutching her results sheet and crying her heart out.\n\n\"I... I scored ninety in science!\" Old Wu shouted excitedly. \"A-Xin! I scored ninety in science! I can eat a month of drumsticks!\"\n\n\"I... I passed math!\" Wang Zhuankai waved his results sheet excitedly. \"My first time passing math! And it's eighty-seven!\"\n\n\"I, me too!\" Lin Yunyun said through tears. \"I scored eighty! I've never scored eighty!\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin watched this scene, and slowly, slowly, lowered his head.\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Qingqing walked to his side, her tone unusually gentle, yet unusually heavy, \"have you noticed something?\"\n\n\"...What?\" A-Xin's voice was a little hoarse.\n\n\"This semester, we developed a total of twenty-eight cheating tools.\" Qingqing said. \"Every single tool made us read the textbook one more time.\"\n\n\"...\"\n\n\"Every time we 'prepared to cheat,' our grades improved once.\" Qingqing continued. \"We thought we were cheating—but actually, we were studying all along.\"\n\n\"...\"\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Qingqing looked at him, a hint of indefinable complexity in her eyes, \"we seem to... not need to cheat at all.\"\n\n\"—!\"\n\nThose words, like a heavy hammer, slammed into A-Xin's heart.\n\n\"Im, impossible...\" A-Xin's voice trembled. \"We... we clearly...\"\n\n\"Clearly what?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"Clearly...\" A-Xin opened his mouth, but found himself with no rebuttal at all.\n\n\"Waaaah!\" Old Wu was the first to break, covering his ears with both hands. \"I don't want to hear it, I don't want to hear it! We cheated! We definitely cheated! Otherwise how could we score so well!\"\n\n\"Right! It must be cheating!\" Wang Zhuankai echoed. \"It's just that we don't even know how we cheated!\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing watched this group of \"dead-ducks-with-hard-beaks\" classmates and sighed helplessly. \"...Fine. You all be happy then.\"\n\n\"Then... then...\" A-Xin stood frozen, and only after a long while slowly spoke, \"then... our next 'cheating plan'...\"\n\n\"Do we continue?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"...\" A-Xin fell silent.\n\nHe raised his head, looked at the bright red results board under the setting sun, looked at the group of classmates crying and laughing, and finally, he took a deep breath and clenched his fist:\n\n\"...Yes! Of course we continue! Since twenty-eight tools can be confiscated, then we'll—\"\n\nHe paused, fresh fighting spirit blazing in his eyes:\n\n\"—directly use 'the human body'! Plan No. 8: The Ultimate Human Puzzle! Twenty-six people, each memorizing one unit. At the final exam review session, we'll memorize all the 'answers'!\"\n\n\"Memorize them?\" The whole class exchanged glances.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said firmly. \"Since tools can be confiscated, we'll write the answers directly 'into our brains'! Teacher Gao can't confiscate our brains, right?\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing looked at A-Xin, silent for a long time, and finally smiled softly. \"...A-Xin, you've finally found a cheating method that 'can't be confiscated.'\"\n\n\"Of course!\" A-Xin said smugly. \"I'm the strongest cheat strategist!\"\n\nUnder the setting sun, the classroom of Class 6-1 was filled with laughter.\n\nOutside the window, Liu-Liu lay at the ventilation duct, watching this group of \"incorrigible\" trouble-makers, its tail swaying gently, letting out a tender electronic chirp:\n\n\"Beep beep... detecting... a 'no-need-to-cheat' future... getting closer and closer...\""}];
